WEBVTT

00:28.177 --> 00:29.887
[WIND WHISTLING]

00:30.930 --> 00:33.015
[CAMERAMAN] Quiet on
the set. And we're rolling.

00:33.099 --> 00:34.684
[PENGUIN 1] Cody
Maverick interview, take one.

00:34.934 --> 00:36.728
[CODY] So why are you
guys here to interview me?

00:36.811 --> 00:38.938
[INTERVIEWER] It's what
we do. We're a reality film crew.

00:39.522 --> 00:41.357
Should I know some of the
questions before we start?

00:41.441 --> 00:42.942
- Just so I don't...
- No. Just, you know...

00:43.067 --> 00:44.402
- They're, they're easy.
- Okay.

00:44.486 --> 00:46.279
- Can you stand on that box, right there, please?
- Oh, yeah.

00:46.362 --> 00:47.238
Just stand up on that thing.

00:48.406 --> 00:50.158
- Ah, thank you...
- Right there? Whoa, what's the...

00:50.241 --> 00:51.618
What is that?
What is that?

00:51.701 --> 00:53.244
[INTERVIEWER] It's a
sound thing. It's a microphone.

00:53.328 --> 00:54.621
What's up, man?
I'm Cody.

00:54.870 --> 00:56.748
[INTERVIEWER] And
you're what, 14, 15 years old?

00:56.831 --> 00:58.416
Uh, 17 years of age.

00:58.874 --> 01:01.043
And any other skills
besides surfing?

01:01.127 --> 01:03.004
Like, like what?
Like singing and dancing?

01:03.087 --> 01:04.422
- Yeah. Yeah.
- [LAUGHS]

01:06.174 --> 01:08.092
No, not me, man.
I just surf.

01:08.176 --> 01:09.844
- [PENGUIN] Loser.
- I just... Ugh!

01:10.886 --> 01:11.971
Cut it out, Glen.
Stop, man.

01:12.054 --> 01:13.931
[INTERVIEWER] You know, we're
here to make a movie about Cody.

01:14.015 --> 01:15.642
- Does he have to be here?
- Yeah, it's gonna be great.

01:15.850 --> 01:17.769
Can I get in line now
to not see it?

01:17.852 --> 01:18.978
[INTERVIEWER]
We'll re-slate.

01:19.187 --> 01:20.229
Since we're talking
about surfing,

01:20.313 --> 01:22.231
- Yeah.
- why don't you give us your thoughts about surfing?

01:22.398 --> 01:23.358
Surfing. Surfing.

01:23.858 --> 01:24.776
[SUCKS LIPS]

01:24.858 --> 01:25.819
Where do I start?

01:26.068 --> 01:27.529
[INTERVIEWER] How about
just at the beginning?

01:28.279 --> 01:29.739
Okay, well, uh...

01:30.782 --> 01:33.285
So as soon as
there was the first wave, right?

01:34.537 --> 01:35.746
There was the first surfer.

01:37.456 --> 01:39.166
All they needed was,
like, a, um...

01:39.709 --> 01:41.669
You know, something like,
some piece of driftwood,

01:41.752 --> 01:43.337
a block of ice
or something like that.

01:43.920 --> 01:44.963
And then they were off.

01:46.173 --> 01:48.925
And they were hooked, man.
They were hooked.

01:52.346 --> 01:54.682
Up till recent times,
you had your old dudes.

01:55.224 --> 01:56.642
You know, your,
your hang-six cats.

01:56.726 --> 01:57.893
These old guys used to lay down

01:57.976 --> 01:59.687
with these huge,
humongous boards.

02:00.312 --> 02:02.565
And these guys
were the pioneers,

02:03.065 --> 02:06.318
but nobody saw
what surfing could really be,

02:07.027 --> 02:09.321
until Big Z did it.

02:09.739 --> 02:11.156
[INTERVIEWER] Could
you tell us who Big Z was?

02:11.240 --> 02:12.157
[CODY]
Who was Big Z?

02:12.449 --> 02:14.869
You're asking the right guy.
You got, you got that far.

02:15.452 --> 02:17.371
Z is, heh, everything.

02:17.454 --> 02:19.206
Big Z is surfing, man.
I mean, he's...

02:19.665 --> 02:21.792
There may well as not have been
an ocean before Z.

02:21.876 --> 02:23.168
They invented the ocean for him.

02:25.880 --> 02:28.257
He lived so hard 'cause
he wasn't afraid to live.

02:29.633 --> 02:30.926
He wasn't afraid to die.

02:31.301 --> 02:32.469
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

02:43.230 --> 02:44.857
He came to Antarctica
when I was just a kid.

02:47.276 --> 02:48.736
Man, it was just, whew.

02:48.861 --> 02:50.446
It was the biggest thing
that ever happened here.

02:51.988 --> 02:53.240
Then suddenly there he was.

02:54.491 --> 02:55.325
Just...

02:57.035 --> 02:58.245
floating over the water,

02:58.328 --> 02:59.789
just hovering, you know,
like weightless.

03:04.084 --> 03:05.377
Could've walked up to anyone.

03:07.337 --> 03:08.171
And...

03:08.589 --> 03:09.757
he walks right up to me.

03:11.508 --> 03:14.929
And he gives me this awesome,
one-of-a-kind Big Z necklace.

03:16.054 --> 03:16.971
And then he tells me,

03:17.055 --> 03:17.932
"You know, kid,

03:18.599 --> 03:19.516
"you know, never give up.

03:20.142 --> 03:21.811
"Find a way,
'cause that's what winners do."

03:26.649 --> 03:27.524
He was the greatest.

03:30.026 --> 03:33.363
Everyone looked up to him,
respected him, loved him.

03:34.531 --> 03:35.449
And one day,

03:36.116 --> 03:37.661
one day
I'm gonna be just like him.

03:38.119 --> 03:41.247
[ROCK MUSIC PLAYING]

03:51.382 --> 03:53.384
And I've been surfing
ever since I can remember.

03:54.886 --> 03:56.638
It's just hard to imagine
any part of my life

03:56.721 --> 03:57.555
when I wasn't surfing.

03:58.014 --> 03:59.808
I wanna get outta here,
you know,

03:59.891 --> 04:00.976
and this is my ticket out.

04:01.476 --> 04:02.393
I'm really good, man.

04:02.477 --> 04:03.394
[SCREAMS]

04:03.478 --> 04:04.562
I'm the best on the island.

04:04.896 --> 04:06.731
[SCOFFS] I know it sounds
cocky for saying that, but...

04:07.482 --> 04:08.399
I mean, I am, like...

04:08.483 --> 04:09.526
[SCREAMING]

04:10.026 --> 04:11.027
...the best.

04:11.820 --> 04:12.696
[GRUNTS]

04:16.533 --> 04:17.742
[WIND WHISTLING]

04:17.826 --> 04:20.119
[CODY] Yeah, I was, I was born
and raised here in Shiverpool.

04:22.747 --> 04:24.081
Lived here my whole life.

04:24.833 --> 04:25.917
That's where they sort the fish.

04:26.918 --> 04:28.252
It's the dumbest thing
I've ever heard of.

04:28.795 --> 04:30.005
But yeah, I, I worked there

04:30.672 --> 04:33.800
just to kinda pacify my mom
a little bit.

04:34.258 --> 04:35.385
Good old Shiverpool.

04:35.468 --> 04:36.386
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

04:36.469 --> 04:39.430
[CHUCKLES]
This place sucks, bro. Oh!

04:39.764 --> 04:42.350
[YIDDISH ACCENT] I worked
my way up from the sardine pile,

04:42.475 --> 04:43.977
- uh, then to the mackerel pile.
- In his day.

04:44.060 --> 04:46.062
And I ended up
on the gefilte fish pile.

04:46.145 --> 04:47.146
- In my day.
- All hard work.

04:47.230 --> 04:48.773
Not like some's I could mention.

04:48.857 --> 04:50.775
Yes, this farkakte kid
with the thing on the water.

04:51.401 --> 04:53.319
My house?
It's down over there.

04:53.403 --> 04:54.738
You see it right there
with the surfboards?

04:55.780 --> 04:57.198
Yeah, I mean
I just live here with me

04:57.281 --> 04:58.950
and my brother Glen, my mom.

05:00.076 --> 05:02.704
He was a little, teeny,
small egg. Uh...

05:03.162 --> 05:04.539
He wasn't very impressive.

05:05.415 --> 05:07.375
Glen was the big egg,
Cody was the small egg.

05:08.043 --> 05:10.378
He can't help it. He's...
That's just the way he is.

05:10.587 --> 05:13.757
I mean, he's out there
in the water all day.

05:13.840 --> 05:14.883
[PENGUIN]
All day.

05:14.966 --> 05:16.342
You know, shirking
his responsibilities.

05:16.426 --> 05:17.468
[PENGUIN]
Yeah, shirking.

05:17.552 --> 05:20.221
You know, hatching these eggs
is a big responsibility.

05:20.304 --> 05:21.347
[PENGUIN]
It sounds like it.

05:21.431 --> 05:23.182
And my brother Cody,
he just doesn't understand that.

05:23.266 --> 05:24.225
- Mm-hmm.
- He needs to...

05:24.434 --> 05:26.019
step up and be a man.

05:26.227 --> 05:27.979
It takes a real man
to sit on an egg.

05:28.063 --> 05:29.064
Oh, you know it.

05:29.146 --> 05:30.565
Quincy, come to Daddy.

05:30.815 --> 05:33.150
He wants to be different.
All the time with the different.

05:33.234 --> 05:34.277
Who's got the time in the day...

05:34.360 --> 05:36.071
- [YELPS]
- Only six months in a day.

05:36.279 --> 05:37.906
- [INTERVIEWER] Thanks for making it.
- Yeah, sorry.

05:37.989 --> 05:40.742
- Thanks for making it.
- Yeah, how was it out there?

05:40.951 --> 05:42.578
He's the big brother.
I'm the little brother.

05:43.287 --> 05:44.371
I'm not touching you.

05:44.914 --> 05:46.082
- Not gonna touch you.
- Do you see this?

05:46.290 --> 05:47.708
- Don't. Get... Please?
- I'm not.

05:48.042 --> 05:49.418
He makes sure
that I know that too.

05:49.919 --> 05:51.087
[CODY]
I had to fight for everything.

05:51.336 --> 05:53.213
I mean, even Mom's
tuna casserole, you know.

05:53.297 --> 05:54.214
[HUMMING]

05:54.715 --> 05:55.633
[BOTH GRUNT]

05:56.050 --> 05:56.968
Yeah, here we go.

05:57.051 --> 05:58.260
[BOTH GRUNT]

05:58.343 --> 05:59.177
[GAGS]

05:59.261 --> 06:00.471
[COUGHS]

06:00.554 --> 06:01.639
[CODY]
I'm lucky I survived.

06:01.806 --> 06:04.266
It really wasn't that easy
for him growing up.

06:05.392 --> 06:07.269
Like I said before, uh...

06:08.104 --> 06:10.439
he never, he never
really knew his father.

06:13.317 --> 06:15.069
[CODY] I'm not really
the person to ask about it,

06:15.151 --> 06:17.029
truthfully, 'cause I was just
too young to remember.

06:17.738 --> 06:20.365
I mean... Look, I'm not
the only kid on the island

06:20.449 --> 06:22.242
whose dad was, you know...

06:22.910 --> 06:23.744
eaten.

06:24.745 --> 06:26.330
[INTERVIEWER]
Still, it had to be traumatic.

06:26.413 --> 06:27.623
No. Not for me, bro.

06:28.373 --> 06:29.291
Not for me.

06:31.293 --> 06:32.294
[INTERVIEWER]
What's your dream?

06:32.461 --> 06:34.505
To go, uh, a-away.

06:35.006 --> 06:35.965
To go away.

06:36.048 --> 06:37.257
That's, that's, That's great.

06:37.466 --> 06:38.467
Do you guys want a drink?

06:38.843 --> 06:40.719
Gotta run away
from responsibility and life.

06:40.803 --> 06:41.887
They don't want a drink.

06:41.971 --> 06:43.514
This is kind of...
This is unique.

06:43.597 --> 06:44.890
This is, this is not the norm.

06:44.974 --> 06:45.891
[MOCKINGLY]
"I have dreams."

06:45.975 --> 06:46.892
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

06:47.018 --> 06:48.310
When is this not happening?

06:48.393 --> 06:49.937
What...
Don't make that noise.

06:50.021 --> 06:51.105
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

06:51.939 --> 06:53.941
- Cody!
- It's really disrespectful.

06:54.025 --> 06:54.942
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

06:55.067 --> 06:57.111
- I would never do that.
- Mm-hmm.

06:58.821 --> 07:00.364
You just wouldn't make it
out of your mouth.

07:00.447 --> 07:02.074
That's the difference
between you and me.

07:02.158 --> 07:03.868
You know what?
I can't do this anymore.

07:04.785 --> 07:06.244
Mom...
Look what you did.

07:06.328 --> 07:07.454
This is for me.
This isn't for you.

07:07.538 --> 07:08.455
Why is Glen still here?

07:08.539 --> 07:10.749
Oh, yeah, exactly. Mom!

07:10.833 --> 07:11.750
[SLOW MUSIC PLAYING]

07:11.834 --> 07:13.752
[CODY] I don't understand why
everybody has to be so judgmental.

07:13.836 --> 07:15.004
I understand
why Mom's judgmental.

07:15.921 --> 07:17.631
I think it's 'cause
she cares partially.

07:18.007 --> 07:20.968
I think it's also partially 'cause
everyone else is looking at her like,

07:21.052 --> 07:22.260
"Hey, Cody's just a bum.

07:22.344 --> 07:24.138
"Cody's this. Cody's that.
Cody's this."

07:25.263 --> 07:27.307
Cody's me, bro.
Let me be me.

07:28.350 --> 07:29.643
When is that gonna start?

07:42.781 --> 07:44.491
[PENGUIN] You know what
they call me? The dream maker.

07:44.658 --> 07:46.285
The dream maker.

07:46.661 --> 07:48.705
I find these kids,
I bring them here,

07:49.206 --> 07:52.167
and I give them a chance
to be somebody.

07:53.334 --> 07:56.337
You know, my greatest joy
as a surf promoter? Finding Z.

07:56.421 --> 07:57.714
Watching him rise to the top.

07:58.215 --> 07:59.549
I still can't believe he's gone.

07:59.632 --> 08:01.384
He was like a son to me,
you know.

08:02.385 --> 08:04.179
It was a heart thing, you know.
It was a heart...

08:04.846 --> 08:06.139
[TEARFULLY]
Can we just take five minutes?

08:06.556 --> 08:07.515
How's my hair?
Is it messed up?

08:07.599 --> 08:09.893
I ain't got all day.
Shut up. Is it mussed?

08:09.976 --> 08:11.686
[INTERVIEWER] We just have
more questions about Big Z.

08:11.770 --> 08:13.354
Right now I think
we're more interested

08:13.438 --> 08:15.190
in telling
the Reggie Belafonte story,

08:15.273 --> 08:16.149
and who could blame us?

08:16.233 --> 08:17.943
But Big Z is kind of
the focus of our...

08:18.026 --> 08:19.903
Hey! Let's get the
coconut-filler guy over here.

08:19.986 --> 08:21.571
And how about the guy
sweeping the sand?

08:21.654 --> 08:23.198
Can we hear your boring story

08:23.281 --> 08:24.991
about your tedious,
ridiculous life?

08:25.075 --> 08:25.909
Hm? Me?

08:25.992 --> 08:27.493
Get your feathers off it!
Stop! Stop!

08:27.577 --> 08:29.621
I ain't got all day. I got
a big production here, okay?

08:29.704 --> 08:30.830
Roll, okay? Just roll!

08:31.414 --> 08:35.334
[ANNOUNCER] Welcome, fans,
to another edition of SPEN Sports.

08:35.752 --> 08:37.378
This is Sal Masekela,

08:37.462 --> 08:40.006
and we're here at the
surfing capital of the world,

08:40.298 --> 08:41.758
Pen Gu Island,

08:41.841 --> 08:43.760
for a preview
of the tenth annual

08:43.843 --> 08:46.054
Big Z Memorial Surf Off.

08:47.097 --> 08:50.475
Professional surfers
extraordinaire Kelly and Rob,

08:50.725 --> 08:54.562
tell us what kind of challenges
our surfers are going to face.

08:54.646 --> 08:56.481
Well, first things first, Sal,
the wave.

08:56.689 --> 08:59.025
It's the perfect combination
of beauty and danger.

08:59.109 --> 09:00.819
Even the pros
are terrified of this place.

09:00.902 --> 09:01.861
[PENGUIN]
Whoo!

09:02.695 --> 09:03.822
[CROWD GASPS]

09:04.697 --> 09:05.573
Hi, Mom!

09:05.782 --> 09:07.742
Dig this, Sal.
Section behind me.

09:07.867 --> 09:09.327
It's called "The Boneyards."

09:09.535 --> 09:12.371
Very few surfers have ventured
in there and come out alive.

09:12.455 --> 09:14.791
[SAL] Are you trying to tell
me people have died here?

09:15.041 --> 09:16.084
That's right, Sal.

09:16.168 --> 09:17.418
[SAL]
A moment of silence for them.

09:17.919 --> 09:19.087
And we keep it moving!

09:19.545 --> 09:21.965
Because if the Boneyards
was not enough,

09:22.048 --> 09:24.383
our surfers will be
facing off with

09:24.467 --> 09:25.969
Tank "The Shredder" Evans.

09:26.178 --> 09:28.638
Tank, nine-time defending champ.

09:28.721 --> 09:29.639
[GRUNTS]

09:29.931 --> 09:31.683
A role model? No.

09:31.891 --> 09:33.185
But I do consider myself

09:33.268 --> 09:34.936
somebody that everyone
should look up to.

09:35.270 --> 09:37.981
Kids should try to, uh,
pretend that they're Tank.

09:38.273 --> 09:39.232
I mean, they should try.

09:39.316 --> 09:40.566
[SCOFFS]
Good luck, kids.

09:41.651 --> 09:43.028
[INTERVIEWER]
You never wanna get in there...

09:43.111 --> 09:46.323
and help 'em out,
show 'em how to surf...

09:46.405 --> 09:47.448
[WHIMPERING]

09:47.532 --> 09:48.449
and spend time with the kids?

09:48.533 --> 09:49.827
No, no, I don't wanna do that.

09:49.994 --> 09:51.120
Anyway, this is my wave.

09:51.204 --> 09:52.663
[SAL]
Always classy, Tank Evans.

09:52.746 --> 09:54.581
Coming up after the break,
penguin dodge ball.

09:54.665 --> 09:55.541
Stick around.

09:56.542 --> 09:58.336
Okay, to get back
to the competition,

09:58.418 --> 09:59.712
I just wanna say, uh,

10:00.129 --> 10:02.673
I'm scouring the globe
for the next big thing.

10:02.756 --> 10:03.674
Ow, oh.

10:03.757 --> 10:04.633
But that's another story.

10:09.429 --> 10:11.057
[MIKE] He doesn't look
for them. I find them.

10:11.140 --> 10:13.100
I find these penguins.
I find the talent.

10:13.893 --> 10:15.477
Reggie, uh, my boss, has sent me

10:15.561 --> 10:16.854
literally everywhere
on this trip.

10:16.937 --> 10:19.690
Any place there's an ocean,
a lake, a puddle.

10:19.773 --> 10:21.025
It's ridiculous.

10:22.193 --> 10:24.528
I am on so much
migraine medication,

10:24.611 --> 10:25.612
you have no idea.

10:25.696 --> 10:27.948
The stress is killing me.

10:28.032 --> 10:29.283
I don't know how much longer
I can last.

10:29.367 --> 10:30.450
I have to tell you that
right now.

10:30.534 --> 10:31.410
[YELPS]

10:32.661 --> 10:33.579
Whoa.

10:33.871 --> 10:36.123
You gotta try
this blowhole thing, man.

10:36.207 --> 10:38.167
This whale dude
is giving me a brain freeze.

10:39.459 --> 10:40.419
I, uh...

10:41.212 --> 10:42.213
I lost a bet.

10:42.338 --> 10:43.256
Whoo!

10:43.381 --> 10:45.216
Excuse me.
Excuse me.

10:45.632 --> 10:48.677
Does anybody in this entire
frozen wasteland surf?

10:49.262 --> 10:50.930
Ah, the Cody Maverick kid
does that.

10:51.013 --> 10:53.640
Wonderful, thank you. You know
you're sitting on thin ice.

10:53.724 --> 10:54.600
[ICE CRACKS]
Oi!

10:54.683 --> 10:55.726
Excuse me,
I'm looking for, uh...

10:55.809 --> 10:57.395
I'm looking for Cody Maverick.

10:57.477 --> 10:59.313
Has anyone seen Cody Maverick?

10:59.397 --> 11:00.814
I'm, I'm Cody Maverick.

11:01.190 --> 11:02.024
[GRUNTS]

11:02.108 --> 11:03.276
[MIKE] Holy... Mike Abromowitz

11:03.359 --> 11:05.736
from the Big Z Memorial
Surf-Off, Pen Gu Island.

11:05.819 --> 11:07.696
You came here on a wha...
You came to see me. Wow!

11:07.780 --> 11:09.531
Quite a slip-and-slider,
aren't ya?

11:09.615 --> 11:10.908
[CHUCKLING]
You're here. I...

11:11.117 --> 11:12.910
What an honor, sir.
I'm honestly so honored.

11:12.993 --> 11:14.578
Lovely, wonderful.
So I hear you, uh, surf.

11:14.661 --> 11:16.289
- Is this true?
- You gotta see what I can do.

11:16.372 --> 11:18.332
- You can actually stand on a board?
- Please. I'll be right back.

11:18.416 --> 11:21.335
You'll see what I can do, be happy,
everything'll be good, and I'm coming with you.

11:21.752 --> 11:23.045
I can't imagine a better day.

11:23.379 --> 11:24.797
[LAUGHING]
Ma! Ma.

11:24.880 --> 11:27.465
Ma, he came... The scout.
Mikey. He came. He's here.

11:27.549 --> 11:30.177
- What? Yeah.
- He's giving me a shot now, Ma.

11:30.261 --> 11:31.971
- Okay.
- You wanna come watch me surf, mom?

11:32.054 --> 11:34.181
- No, no, that's okay.
- Just this time.

11:34.265 --> 11:35.557
I'm busy.
I'm chopping here.

11:36.683 --> 11:38.978
Okay. All right,
well, wish me luck.

11:39.061 --> 11:42.398
Cody, just be careful
of those big waves. Mm-mmm.

11:45.483 --> 11:47.527
Well?
Anytime now.

11:47.861 --> 11:50.656
You know, you... You should
have been here yesterday.

11:50.739 --> 11:51.949
We had a sweet swell yesterday.

11:52.032 --> 11:54.535
I mean, I was doing
some layback 360s and floaters.

11:54.619 --> 11:56.663
- It was insane.
- Wow! Start the whale.

11:56.746 --> 11:59.249
No! No, no, no. Wait! Wait!
Just give me one more chance.

11:59.333 --> 12:00.667
- All I need is one, please.
- You just had it.

12:00.750 --> 12:02.877
- Dude, please don't go.
- Tough break, kid.

12:02.961 --> 12:04.921
- Just wait one second.
- Better luck next year. Move it.

12:05.005 --> 12:07.299
- Let's go. He's coming. Let's go.
- One wave. That's all I need.

12:07.382 --> 12:08.216
- Let's go.
- Please.

12:09.009 --> 12:11.761
[CODY] I never, you know,
won anything my whole life.

12:13.805 --> 12:16.266
You know, just once
I wanna feel like a winner.

12:16.724 --> 12:18.601
You know,
I used to scout songbirds.

12:19.019 --> 12:20.979
Toucans for this musical revue
in Brazil.

12:21.062 --> 12:23.231
Now that's show business.
Toucans...

12:23.315 --> 12:24.149
[CODY]
Hold on!

12:25.442 --> 12:28.028
I don't care what you say,
I'm coming to Pen Gu!

12:28.403 --> 12:30.447
No way, no how.

12:30.529 --> 12:33.408
This is a contest
for big-wave surfers.

12:33.616 --> 12:34.784
Can't this blubber ball
go any faster?

12:34.868 --> 12:35.743
Step on it, fish sticks!

12:37.954 --> 12:39.747
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

12:43.001 --> 12:43.918
[PENGUIN]
Is he all right?

12:44.002 --> 12:44.919
[MEN CHATTERING]

12:45.003 --> 12:46.880
Oh, poor kid.
I feel bad a little bit.

12:47.047 --> 12:47.922
Honestly, this is embar...

12:48.006 --> 12:48.923
[CODY]
No, wait! Wait!

12:52.593 --> 12:53.512
[GRUNTS]

12:53.636 --> 12:54.513
[PANTING]

12:55.889 --> 12:57.182
[MEN CHATTERING]

12:59.184 --> 13:00.060
[CODY YELLS]

13:01.395 --> 13:03.271
[PENGUIN] Did you guys see
that? He almost had my board.

13:04.356 --> 13:07.108
He almost had it. Oh, next
time. Next time we'll get it.

13:07.234 --> 13:08.276
Yeah, so anyway...

13:08.360 --> 13:09.277
- [CODY] Wait!
- [YELPS]

13:19.413 --> 13:20.372
[GASPING]

13:25.710 --> 13:27.212
[GRUNTING]

13:28.338 --> 13:29.381
[MEN CHATTERING]

13:30.631 --> 13:31.883
[PENGUIN GRUNTING]
We got you. We got you.

13:31.966 --> 13:33.760
Oh, you are heavier
than you look.

13:34.511 --> 13:35.929
Whoo! Man, we did it.

13:36.012 --> 13:37.722
- Oh, thank you.
- Teamwork always pays off.

13:37.931 --> 13:38.890
I'm Chicken Joe, man.

13:38.973 --> 13:39.807
Oh, thanks, Joe.

13:39.891 --> 13:42.269
Don't you ever, ever
do anything like that

13:42.352 --> 13:43.395
in the contest, all right?

13:43.478 --> 13:44.771
- I'm in?
- Yeah, you're in.

13:44.854 --> 13:48.275
'Cause that was entertaining
in a horrifying sort of way.

13:48.358 --> 13:49.692
[ALL CHATTERING]

13:50.151 --> 13:51.319
- Right on, dude.
- Yeah.

13:52.737 --> 13:55.532
My name's Cody Maverick,
Shiverpool. You?

13:55.740 --> 13:57.952
No, I'm not from Shiverpool.

13:58.369 --> 13:59.579
Oh. Where are you from?

14:00.455 --> 14:01.747
Dude, I'm from Lake Michigan.

14:01.914 --> 14:03.082
That's where I surf.

14:03.291 --> 14:06.586
I was the only one
around my town who did it.

14:06.668 --> 14:08.879
And uh, a lot of people
thought I was crazy,

14:08.963 --> 14:10.256
but I'm used to that.

14:10.339 --> 14:11.257
I know how you feel, Joe.

14:11.882 --> 14:12.883
- You do?
- Yeah.

14:13.593 --> 14:14.510
Radical.

14:17.138 --> 14:18.347
Whoo-hoo-hoo!

14:18.680 --> 14:20.516
Butt freeze! Whoo.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.601
Somebody help the chicken.

14:21.683 --> 14:23.561
[ROCK MUSIC PLAYING]

14:44.457 --> 14:45.458
[MUSIC CONTINUES]

14:53.633 --> 14:54.758
[LAUGHS]

15:00.431 --> 15:01.557
- [SCREAMS]
- Look out!

15:01.641 --> 15:02.475
Ha!

15:03.309 --> 15:05.394
Slater, Machado.
How's it goin', bros?

15:05.478 --> 15:06.646
- Goin' good. Thanks.
- What's up, buddy?

15:06.728 --> 15:08.063
Okay.
Later, dudes.

15:09.315 --> 15:10.732
Radical.

15:20.284 --> 15:21.577
[ALL GRUNTING]

15:24.788 --> 15:25.706
[MUSIC CONTINUES]

15:31.753 --> 15:34.131
[CODY LAUGHING] Dude, look,
look where I'm standing.

15:34.215 --> 15:35.132
I'm standing where Z stood.

15:35.383 --> 15:36.634
[LAUGHS]

15:37.134 --> 15:38.636
Aw, man. Aw, man.

15:38.719 --> 15:40.471
Dude, you gotta try this.

15:41.013 --> 15:42.264
No, I'm, I'm okay.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.599
Come on.
Just one bite.

15:43.683 --> 15:44.559
All right.

15:44.892 --> 15:45.893
One bite, that's it.

15:47.603 --> 15:49.188
Yeah, yeah?
What do you think?

15:49.605 --> 15:51.691
I mean, it's not bad.
It kind of tastes like chick...

15:52.233 --> 15:54.652
- Yep. What's chi... Chi...
- Chi...

15:54.735 --> 15:55.695
[GIRL]
Coming through!

15:56.278 --> 15:57.321
Oh, crap.

15:58.947 --> 16:00.241
Can't believe
he'd do this to me.

16:01.826 --> 16:02.869
[GIRL PANTING]

16:02.952 --> 16:04.621
Oh, man.
I'm in love.

16:05.497 --> 16:08.083
Help me! I'm drowning!

16:10.877 --> 16:12.003
[COUGHING]

16:12.087 --> 16:14.256
Then what're you standing here
next to me for?

16:14.339 --> 16:15.632
Go talk to her, man.

16:15.716 --> 16:16.841
No, I'm not gonna talk to her.

16:16.925 --> 16:17.842
- She's digging on you.
- Joe.

16:17.967 --> 16:19.052
- She called you crap.
- Joe.

16:19.219 --> 16:21.096
- Thanks again.
- All right, well,

16:21.179 --> 16:23.599
this is the third time you've
been unconscious this week.

16:23.973 --> 16:25.726
I just don't think
it's very good for your brain.

16:25.808 --> 16:28.144
- I know. Bye, Lani.
- Okay.

16:28.228 --> 16:29.354
Joe, j-j-j...

16:29.438 --> 16:31.856
Yeah, that was awesome how
you, uh, saved his life and all.

16:31.940 --> 16:32.815
That was just...

16:33.316 --> 16:35.360
unbelievable, ahem, really.

16:35.736 --> 16:37.112
- [CHUCKLES]
- Yeah.

16:37.571 --> 16:39.155
You here for the surf contest?

16:39.239 --> 16:40.407
Uh, mm-hmm.

16:40.823 --> 16:42.784
Well, I'll be watching you.

16:43.619 --> 16:44.994
Really?
You'll be watching me?

16:45.287 --> 16:46.955
Well, yeah,
from the lifeguard station.

16:47.038 --> 16:49.332
- Oh, yeah. No, yeah. Yeah. Right.
- It's my, it's my job.

16:49.541 --> 16:50.417
That's your job.

16:50.500 --> 16:52.419
Hey, are you gonna kiss her
or what? What's going on?

16:52.502 --> 16:54.129
- [GIGGLES]
- Come on, Joe. We gotta...

16:54.212 --> 16:55.338
Dude, you said you were in love.

16:55.422 --> 16:57.257
- I didn't say that.
- All right, look. He really digs you.

16:57.340 --> 16:58.425
- Joe, listen to me.
- [LANI GIGGLES]

16:58.508 --> 17:00.009
- He likes you, though. See ya.
- Shhh!

17:00.719 --> 17:02.679
[LANI] Yeah, I love my job.
I have an amazing job.

17:02.971 --> 17:05.056
Just this week, with the contest
coming up and all,

17:05.140 --> 17:06.391
it's a little crazy.

17:06.849 --> 17:09.311
You really have to be
extra, extra attentive.

17:09.394 --> 17:11.313
When you have so many guys
in the water,

17:11.396 --> 17:12.397
you can't miss a thing.

17:12.564 --> 17:14.899
But you know what?
I have a perfect record.

17:15.024 --> 17:16.526
I've never lost anybody.

17:17.110 --> 17:18.445
Sure, there have been
close calls, but...

17:18.528 --> 17:19.862
[WHIMPERING]
Help!

17:19.946 --> 17:21.531
Oh, Arnold.
I turn my back for one...

17:21.948 --> 17:23.450
Just lay some feeling on her.

17:23.533 --> 17:25.661
- How do you mean?
- You know, through words.

17:25.744 --> 17:27.496
- Through touch.
- Walk me through the approach.

17:27.579 --> 17:28.997
I'm Lani. You're me.

17:29.080 --> 17:30.081
You sure about that?

17:30.290 --> 17:31.583
I get real serious.

17:31.667 --> 17:33.251
Let's not. Let's not.

17:33.669 --> 17:35.003
- Whoa.
- What is it?

17:35.587 --> 17:36.421
That's it.

17:36.879 --> 17:38.131
That's Big Z's shrine.

17:38.381 --> 17:39.299
Remember?

17:39.424 --> 17:41.551
[JOE]
Ye... No, no. Not really.

17:43.219 --> 17:46.222
[ANNOUNCER] Today, the world
of surfing lost one of its legends.

17:46.973 --> 17:49.851
Big Z took his final ride
this morning

17:50.059 --> 17:51.186
during a competition

17:51.520 --> 17:53.814
with up-and-coming surfer,
Tank Evans.

17:54.981 --> 17:59.402
Z was last seen paddling into
a massive swell off Pen Gu Bay.

18:09.455 --> 18:11.081
Friends of Big Z gathered

18:11.165 --> 18:13.710
to remember and celebrate
his life.

18:15.670 --> 18:16.962
- [THUD]
- [TANK] Great shot.

18:17.380 --> 18:18.715
- [CODY] What? Hey!
- [TANK] Yes.

18:18.798 --> 18:20.466
Oh. Every time.

18:20.550 --> 18:22.176
He's got a pretty good
throwing fin.

18:22.259 --> 18:24.554
Hey, stop doing... Hey.
Stop it! Cut it out!

18:24.970 --> 18:26.764
That's like three in a row.

18:26.848 --> 18:27.931
Here, give it a shot.

18:28.641 --> 18:29.559
[GRUNTS]

18:29.642 --> 18:30.560
Hey!

18:30.643 --> 18:32.687
What? Wait a minute.

18:32.770 --> 18:34.938
[LAUGHING]
Look at this.

18:35.022 --> 18:35.857
Don't.

18:35.939 --> 18:37.316
- It's a Big Z necklace.
- Stop. Stop it.

18:37.608 --> 18:38.860
- That's not funny. Stop.
- [LAUGHING]

18:38.942 --> 18:40.820
Hey! No, no, no. Stop.
What are you doing?

18:40.903 --> 18:43.113
[TANK] Look, everybody,
it's Big Z's last fan.

18:43.197 --> 18:44.866
[REGGIE] Coming through.
Outta the way. Let's go.

18:44.948 --> 18:46.992
- You don't deserve to talk about him.
- He's a big zero.

18:47.076 --> 18:48.619
- Shut your mouth.
- Zero starts with Z.

18:48.703 --> 18:51.414
You'll never be
as good as Big Z, Stank.

18:51.497 --> 18:52.415
[CROWD GASPS]

18:53.123 --> 18:54.417
[JOE]
Hey, hey, people.

18:54.500 --> 18:56.586
Come on now.
Smile on your brother.

18:56.669 --> 18:57.670
Keep your girlfriend
out of this!

18:58.379 --> 18:59.963
Hey, whoa.
You can't do that to my friend.

19:00.047 --> 19:01.006
[GRUNTING]

19:01.758 --> 19:03.467
Wow, I'm getting
quite a workout there.

19:03.551 --> 19:04.635
No, that feels good.

19:05.135 --> 19:06.929
Hey, why don't you work
on my glutes a little bit?

19:07.054 --> 19:07.971
Ooh, that's very nice.

19:08.055 --> 19:09.056
[YELPS]

19:09.139 --> 19:11.016
- Whoa, whoa, whoa! All right.
- What?

19:11.100 --> 19:12.226
That's enough, guys.
Come on.

19:12.309 --> 19:14.144
I'll take you on
any time, anywhere!

19:14.228 --> 19:17.981
Oh, well, then how about
right here, right now, huh?

19:18.065 --> 19:19.316
- Hey, Mikey, Mikey!
- What?

19:19.400 --> 19:20.526
Get this kid a board.

19:20.651 --> 19:24.280
All right, who wants to see
the little guy take on the champ?

19:24.363 --> 19:26.115
- [CROWD CHEERS]
- Little guys rule!

19:26.449 --> 19:28.367
[REGGIE]
A little one-on-one

19:28.451 --> 19:31.287
surfing action
between Tank Evans

19:31.370 --> 19:33.330
- and... Jerry...
- [MIKE GRUNTING]

19:33.497 --> 19:34.665
Cody. Cody.

19:34.749 --> 19:35.625
[GASPS]
Cody Maverick.

19:35.708 --> 19:36.542
Cody Mavencourt.

19:37.042 --> 19:40.003
And the one that rides
the biggest wave wins!

19:40.087 --> 19:42.298
[ROCK MUSIC PLAYING]

19:52.099 --> 19:54.936
- [INTERVIEWER] Are you nervous about
going against Tank Evans? - [CODY] What?

19:55.018 --> 19:56.437
[CODY]
What? Ah, Tank. Nervous?

19:56.520 --> 19:57.605
What do I have
to be nervous about?

20:02.819 --> 20:03.778
Yeah.

20:04.987 --> 20:05.947
[PANTING]

20:12.621 --> 20:14.122
[CROWD APPLAUDING]

20:17.125 --> 20:18.376
- Give it up! Come on, now!
- [CROWD CHEERS]

20:18.710 --> 20:20.587
I'm gonna chum the water
with your head.

20:20.671 --> 20:22.130
Bring it on, pecker face.
Let's go.

20:22.464 --> 20:23.381
Pecker face?

20:28.219 --> 20:29.179
[BOTH]
It's mine!

20:39.731 --> 20:41.566
[INTERVIEWER] So, Cody,
when you take your first wave

20:41.817 --> 20:43.318
and the whole island's
there to watch,

20:43.401 --> 20:44.361
what's it gonna be like?

20:44.444 --> 20:45.320
[CODY]
It's gonna be amazing.

20:45.403 --> 20:47.238
Honestly, it'll be
the best wave of my life.

20:47.364 --> 20:48.657
And I hope the cameras
are rolling

20:48.740 --> 20:49.908
'cause you're gonna
wanna watch it over

20:49.992 --> 20:51.785
and over and over
and over again.

20:52.410 --> 20:53.453
It's gonna be awesome!

20:53.704 --> 20:54.663
[SCREAMS]

20:57.415 --> 20:58.291
[SCREAMS]

21:01.044 --> 21:01.962
[SCREAMS]

21:04.297 --> 21:06.008
[SCREAMS]

21:07.759 --> 21:08.760
[CROWD GROANS]

21:08.886 --> 21:09.761
I can't look.

21:10.387 --> 21:12.180
Poor kid.
He's... Poor kid.

21:12.263 --> 21:13.974
Wow!
That was spectacular!

21:14.057 --> 21:15.017
Whoa!

21:17.477 --> 21:19.730
I'm number one, the Tank!

21:25.276 --> 21:26.194
[GASPS]

21:26.570 --> 21:27.529
[CROWD GASPING]

21:27.779 --> 21:28.697
[PENGUIN]
Watch out!

21:29.489 --> 21:30.407
[GASPING]

21:37.372 --> 21:38.289
[GASPS]

21:42.460 --> 21:43.503
[WATER SPLASHES]

21:54.472 --> 21:56.349
[ROB] We're trying to get the
details, trying to figure it out.

21:56.433 --> 21:57.768
The lifeguard
just pulled him in.

21:59.061 --> 22:00.020
[CROWD MURMURING]

22:01.312 --> 22:03.732
[ROB] That's what happens
when you take on the Tank, right?

22:04.315 --> 22:05.442
[GRUNTING]

22:06.610 --> 22:07.778
Cody! Cody!

22:08.070 --> 22:09.404
How is he? Is he okay?

22:09.487 --> 22:10.530
- What can I do?
- Yeah, he's okay.

22:10.614 --> 22:12.532
I can help though.
Except if there's blood.

22:12.616 --> 22:13.533
[BOY]
Mommy, is he okay?

22:13.618 --> 22:15.286
Just the thought of blood
makes, makes me...

22:15.369 --> 22:16.287
[GROANS]

22:16.621 --> 22:17.872
Can somebody help the chicken?

22:18.456 --> 22:19.791
- [HUMMING]
- Tank, you okay?

22:20.041 --> 22:21.417
- Tank needs fuel.
- [YELPS]

22:21.834 --> 22:22.961
Mikey, get the board, will you?

22:23.044 --> 22:24.128
[TANK]
Blah! Tastes like sh...

22:24.378 --> 22:26.380
Come on, okay.
Come on. Come on.

22:26.464 --> 22:27.590
[COUGHS]

22:27.673 --> 22:28.633
[PENGUIN]
Is he safe?

22:28.716 --> 22:30.009
[CROWD CHATTERING]

22:31.052 --> 22:31.970
Did I win?

22:32.678 --> 22:33.596
I won, huh?

22:33.888 --> 22:35.974
You should've stayed
in Antarctica, kid.

22:37.224 --> 22:38.101
Oh, wow.

22:38.350 --> 22:39.852
- You're gonna be okay.
- Look at that.

22:41.104 --> 22:43.022
There's pixies everywhere.
[GROANS]

22:45.148 --> 22:46.525
[INTERVIEWER] What do
you guys think about Cody

22:46.609 --> 22:48.611
going into a contest
and possibly winning?

22:48.694 --> 22:49.654
- You know, I'm...
- Ha.

22:49.737 --> 22:50.780
Why did you just laugh?

22:51.864 --> 22:53.992
'Cause he keeps
saying "possible."

22:54.075 --> 22:56.285
Like it's "possible"
that you're gonna win.

22:56.368 --> 22:58.121
And like you're
gonna do anything.

22:58.370 --> 23:00.289
- I mean, really, what are the chances?
- Well...

23:00.539 --> 23:01.749
They're high.
Aren't they high?

23:02.333 --> 23:04.418
- [WHISTLING]
- I mean, they're normal chances.

23:04.502 --> 23:05.544
It's not like
I'm like the underdog.

23:05.628 --> 23:06.504
[IMITATES EXPLOSION]

23:06.587 --> 23:07.505
[THUNDER CRASHING]

23:08.547 --> 23:09.507
[GRUNTS]

23:16.931 --> 23:18.474
[LANI]
Hey! Geek!

23:18.933 --> 23:19.892
Geek!

23:19.976 --> 23:21.352
Geek, get up and help me.

23:21.811 --> 23:22.812
[GRUNTS]

23:23.146 --> 23:24.147
[SNORING]

23:24.271 --> 23:25.148
Geek.

23:27.525 --> 23:28.359
Geek!

23:29.192 --> 23:30.235
- Oh!
- Wake up.

23:30.695 --> 23:32.279
- I need your help.
- Lani.

23:32.363 --> 23:34.615
Come on. Get off your lazy butt
and come and help me.

23:34.699 --> 23:36.199
Havin' this beautiful dream.

23:36.283 --> 23:37.200
Okay.

23:37.284 --> 23:38.369
Did you ever know Sheila?

23:38.452 --> 23:39.745
No. I don't
know Sheila.

23:39.912 --> 23:41.789
Wait, wait, wait.
What? What?

23:41.873 --> 23:43.124
- What?
- Who's this guy?

23:43.374 --> 23:44.834
He's... a surfer.
He's hurt.

23:44.917 --> 23:46.209
Who are all those guys?

23:46.293 --> 23:48.087
They're with him.
Ignore them.

23:48.211 --> 23:49.839
- Come on.
- Lani, what are you doing?

23:49.922 --> 23:52.175
If you help him,
they'll go away.

23:52.967 --> 23:54.135
- Hey! Get outta here!
- Okay.

23:54.217 --> 23:55.427
- [PENGUIN]Whoa!
- [LANI] Help him!

23:56.261 --> 23:57.304
[LANI]
Where do you want him?

23:57.388 --> 23:58.639
Nowhere.
That's the whole point.

23:58.723 --> 24:00.892
No outsiders, Lani.
Come on.

24:00.975 --> 24:02.476
- I know, I know, I know.
- [SIGHS]

24:02.560 --> 24:04.770
This is an emergency.
He went down bad over the falls.

24:04.854 --> 24:06.689
I don't know if he, If he...

24:06.772 --> 24:07.690
[SIGHS]

24:07.899 --> 24:08.774
[SCOFFS]

24:09.984 --> 24:11.527
- And did he hit the reef?
- I don't know.

24:11.986 --> 24:13.487
I'm not sure. He got...
I got him after...

24:13.571 --> 24:14.613
Is he your boyfriend, huh?

24:14.697 --> 24:15.990
No. No.
Why would you say...

24:16.074 --> 24:17.240
Wait, wait, wait. Oh.

24:17.659 --> 24:19.369
Looks like he stepped on
a fire urchin.

24:19.494 --> 24:21.496
Stepped on me? Stepped on me?

24:21.621 --> 24:23.582
Are you kiddin'?
This guy was dancin' on me.

24:23.749 --> 24:24.917
I mean, just look at this.

24:25.000 --> 24:28.252
Broken, broken, gone, gone,
broken, broken, broken...

24:28.461 --> 24:29.922
This is... This is pretty bad.

24:30.005 --> 24:33.217
This... This is...
This is really bad.

24:33.633 --> 24:35.219
Ow! Ow!

24:35.301 --> 24:36.386
- What... Cody!
- I hurt.

24:36.469 --> 24:37.429
You're gonna be okay.

24:37.512 --> 24:38.388
- Oh!
- What?

24:38.471 --> 24:39.681
Maybe I shouldn't
have taken that out.

24:39.848 --> 24:42.142
Uh, poison's released.
Wow, amazing.

24:42.226 --> 24:43.143
What's amazing?

24:43.560 --> 24:44.853
That you're still alive.

24:44.937 --> 24:46.396
It's all right though.
I'm gonna fix you up.

24:46.479 --> 24:48.774
I... I can fix your foot
just fine. Just, uh...

24:49.524 --> 24:50.734
Where? Where is it?

24:51.151 --> 24:52.402
Ah, I've been looking
all over for this.

24:52.485 --> 24:53.486
It's a saw!
You just drew a saw!

24:53.570 --> 24:54.571
Don't let him move like that.

24:54.654 --> 24:57.157
He's... He's pushing the poison
all over his body.

24:57.241 --> 24:58.158
[CLEAVER THUDS]

24:58.242 --> 24:59.534
Come on, come on, come on.

24:59.618 --> 25:00.535
- I know he looks...
- [GRUNTS]

25:00.619 --> 25:01.494
Here it is.

25:02.370 --> 25:03.287
[WHISTLING]

25:03.580 --> 25:04.497
[LANI]
What are you doing?

25:04.581 --> 25:05.665
What is he doing?

25:05.749 --> 25:06.792
This is a sure-fire cure.

25:06.875 --> 25:08.210
I learned it from
an old medicine man.

25:08.292 --> 25:10.378
It, uh...
It, well, works wonders.

25:10.462 --> 25:11.379
[CODY]
What is he...

25:11.463 --> 25:12.756
What? No, not that.

25:12.839 --> 25:14.007
Not what?
Not what?

25:14.091 --> 25:15.217
What is he gonna what?

25:15.299 --> 25:16.885
Ah. Come on, now.

25:16.969 --> 25:18.386
- Geek, stop.
- Let's do this.

25:18.678 --> 25:21.181
Lani, can you make
some water sounds?

25:21.265 --> 25:22.182
This is so gross.

25:22.266 --> 25:23.349
- What is water...
- Shhh...

25:23.433 --> 25:24.643
Ah, come on. Here we go.

25:24.726 --> 25:26.603
No, no, no. You...

25:26.686 --> 25:27.854
- [SQUISH]
- [SIGHS]

25:27.938 --> 25:29.439
[CODY SCREAMING]

25:31.150 --> 25:33.068
- Ow!
- Kid, you better keep your mouth shut.

25:33.777 --> 25:34.987
See, what'd I tell you?

25:35.070 --> 25:36.571
- Hold his foot still, Lani.
- All right.

25:36.655 --> 25:38.698
Knock him out or something.
I'm running on empty here.

25:38.782 --> 25:40.324
I'm trying! Ah!

25:41.076 --> 25:41.994
[SIGHS]

25:45.122 --> 25:46.039
So...

25:47.291 --> 25:48.167
how you been?

25:49.084 --> 25:50.627
[INTERVIEWER]
Wow, sea urchin in the foot.

25:50.710 --> 25:51.795
That sounds pretty nasty.

25:51.878 --> 25:52.796
Yeah.

25:52.879 --> 25:53.964
How do you cure something
like that?

25:55.841 --> 25:56.925
You pee on it.

25:57.383 --> 25:58.218
[ALL GIGGLING]

25:58.302 --> 25:59.427
[CHUCKLES]
Oh, that's disgusting.

25:59.511 --> 26:00.428
I know!

26:00.512 --> 26:01.345
Hey.

26:02.430 --> 26:03.765
How long am I stuck
with this guy?

26:03.849 --> 26:05.017
- Till...
- 'Cause, you know, I...

26:05.100 --> 26:05.976
Till he's better.

26:06.268 --> 26:08.645
Well, come back soon and...

26:09.604 --> 26:10.981
please, bring me some clams.

26:11.064 --> 26:12.232
- No. No.
- Lani, I'm running low here.

26:12.565 --> 26:13.650
I can't keep doing this.

26:13.733 --> 26:15.194
You gotta start
taking care of yourself.

26:15.277 --> 26:16.569
- I... Oh, come on.
- Bye.

26:17.821 --> 26:19.531
Bring me some more clams!

26:19.614 --> 26:21.116
Okay!

26:27.081 --> 26:27.915
[MURMURS]

26:27.999 --> 26:30.084
[BURPS]

26:31.961 --> 26:34.421
If it's just as well with you,
I don't wanna talk about Cody.

26:34.797 --> 26:37.217
He lost. That's it.
That's his problem, not mine.

26:37.300 --> 26:39.093
Aren't you concerned
about anybody's well-being?

26:39.177 --> 26:40.553
The kid's fine.
He was born in water.

26:40.636 --> 26:42.013
He's a penguin,
for crying out loud!

26:42.096 --> 26:43.014
Did you see that wave hit him?

26:43.097 --> 26:44.849
Yeah, dude, that's the
whole idea of surfing.

26:44.932 --> 26:46.309
You know, I care. I care!

26:46.600 --> 26:48.102
Mikey! Wait till
you see this.

26:49.062 --> 26:51.689
Look at those little legs.
Tick, tick, ticky. Tick, ticky.

26:51.772 --> 26:54.192
It's the way I walk.
And I'm constantly...

26:54.275 --> 26:55.526
Boom-chicka-chicka.
Boom-chicka-chick...

26:55.609 --> 26:56.652
What's with
the "boom-chicka-boom"?

26:57.737 --> 26:58.821
[JOE]
I can't stand blood.

26:59.864 --> 27:00.948
I can't stand
the sight of blood.

27:01.448 --> 27:04.035
I can't stand...
sight of blood.

27:04.535 --> 27:05.452
Cody!

27:06.453 --> 27:09.040
Dude, have you seen
my friend, Cody?

27:09.957 --> 27:11.084
- Mm-mmm.
- No.

27:11.542 --> 27:12.417
Cody?

27:13.169 --> 27:14.379
[GRUNTS]
Cody?

27:16.421 --> 27:18.174
[GROANS]
He's not under there.

27:18.465 --> 27:21.386
Cody!

27:21.468 --> 27:23.304
[ECHOING]
Cody!

27:23.388 --> 27:24.389
How's it goin', man?

27:28.309 --> 27:29.894
Yeah, so I woke up this morning.

27:29.977 --> 27:31.062
You know,
I didn't know where I was.

27:31.145 --> 27:33.398
And it's never like, a good
place to be when you wake up.

27:33.480 --> 27:34.439
[CHUCKLES]
You know?

27:34.607 --> 27:36.734
Come on. Get up.

27:36.817 --> 27:37.693
[GROANS]
I don't want to.

27:37.777 --> 27:38.652
Breakfast.

27:38.736 --> 27:40.238
Wakey, wakey.
Come on.

27:40.321 --> 27:41.406
I don't want to.

27:42.656 --> 27:43.532
Ow.

27:43.616 --> 27:44.700
- How's your foot?
- My foot?

27:44.951 --> 27:46.286
My foot's fine, but my head...

27:46.369 --> 27:48.288
Good, good, good.
Come on, kid. Get up.

27:49.789 --> 27:50.748
What the...

27:50.831 --> 27:51.749
[SNIFFS]

27:51.832 --> 27:52.750
Ooh!

27:53.293 --> 27:54.835
Yeah, I think I got
a concussion.

27:54.919 --> 27:55.836
Ah!

27:56.129 --> 27:57.130
Sheesh.

27:58.923 --> 28:00.216
You know, you should meet
my brother, Glen.

28:00.300 --> 28:01.426
You guys would really
hit it off.

28:02.260 --> 28:04.845
Oh. No, no, no.
Where's my necklace?

28:04.929 --> 28:06.180
Did you see my necklace?
It's gotta be...

28:06.264 --> 28:07.265
[SIGHS]

28:08.682 --> 28:09.767
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

28:09.850 --> 28:10.768
Ah, big deal.

28:10.851 --> 28:13.187
Get yourself another one
at Reggie's trinket shops.

28:13.271 --> 28:15.522
No, it's not just some
necklace, guy. All right?

28:15.606 --> 28:16.649
He gave it to me himself.

28:16.732 --> 28:17.691
- Who?
- Big Z.

28:17.775 --> 28:18.818
When he came to Shiverpool.

28:20.153 --> 28:22.071
You know, that guy believed
in me when no one else did.

28:22.696 --> 28:24.865
He told me never to give up
and to find a way

28:24.949 --> 28:26.034
'cause that's what winners do.

28:26.118 --> 28:27.453
Yeah, what winners do.
yeah.

28:27.535 --> 28:29.704
It's just... It's funny.
You know, what a loser I became.

28:30.164 --> 28:33.334
Who... cares
what Big Z said?

28:33.417 --> 28:34.876
You gotta... just...

28:35.752 --> 28:37.129
you know,
do things your own way.

28:37.463 --> 28:39.840
I don't, you know,
I don't have a way.

28:42.217 --> 28:44.594
Ah, well, you do now.
Just follow this.

28:45.471 --> 28:47.139
It'll take you back
to North Beach.

28:48.349 --> 28:50.642
Okay, Nice to meet you.
Good luck.

28:50.725 --> 28:52.478
[SLOW SONG PLAYING]

29:00.110 --> 29:01.487
[CODY]
What do I do now? You know?

29:01.569 --> 29:02.654
I can't show my face
on the beach.

29:02.737 --> 29:03.571
I can't go home.

29:07.409 --> 29:09.370
[CODY] You always visualize
where you're gonna be,

29:09.453 --> 29:10.287
what you're gonna do.

29:15.083 --> 29:16.001
[CODY]
This ain't it.

29:38.899 --> 29:39.900
Ah.

29:41.568 --> 29:42.444
[CHUCKLES]

29:45.572 --> 29:46.448
What are you doin' here?

29:47.657 --> 29:48.783
- Here.
- [GASPS]

29:48.909 --> 29:51.245
Oh, man.
Thank you, man. This...

29:51.828 --> 29:52.662
Yeah.

29:52.746 --> 29:54.498
That's really cool of you
to come back, man. Thank you.

29:54.581 --> 29:55.749
Better keep that knot tight.

29:56.375 --> 29:58.544
You lose it during a contest,
it's a goner.

29:58.626 --> 30:01.963
Yeah, well, I'm not going
in any surf contests.

30:02.423 --> 30:03.715
Ah, well...

30:04.299 --> 30:05.759
there's more to surfing
than beating...

30:06.593 --> 30:07.802
Tank Evans, you know.

30:09.763 --> 30:10.805
- [SIGHS]
- Yeah.

30:11.639 --> 30:12.682
Ha, look at that.

30:12.766 --> 30:14.268
You know what
you're sitting on there?

30:14.351 --> 30:15.269
Huh.

30:15.352 --> 30:16.270
That's koa wood.

30:16.853 --> 30:18.897
Best surfboards in the world
are made of that stuff.

30:18.980 --> 30:19.898
Yeah?

30:20.607 --> 30:21.816
You got a koa board?

30:22.401 --> 30:23.735
No, I don't have
a "board" board.

30:24.236 --> 30:25.195
Ah, well...

30:26.654 --> 30:27.739
you wanna, uh...

30:28.823 --> 30:29.824
You wanna make one?

30:31.453 --> 30:32.370
Nah.

30:32.454 --> 30:33.288
What?

30:33.371 --> 30:35.790
Man, I come all the way back
here to give you the necklace,

30:35.873 --> 30:38.126
and now I'm offering to make you
a board, and you say, "Nah"?

30:38.418 --> 30:40.836
- I just...
- Get off your lazy butt.

30:40.920 --> 30:43.131
- We're making a board. Come on.
- All right. Okay.

30:43.214 --> 30:44.966
Gonna be the best board you
ever had, I'll tell you that.

30:45.049 --> 30:47.051
- Then, okay. Okay, man.
- All right?

30:47.427 --> 30:48.303
Cody.

30:48.386 --> 30:49.304
[ANIMAL ROARS]

30:50.930 --> 30:51.931
That's cool.

30:52.557 --> 30:53.724
[INTERVIEWER]
Joe, can you just tell us

30:53.808 --> 30:55.560
why you're out here
looking for Cody?

30:55.643 --> 30:57.979
You know, we've known
each other way back

30:58.062 --> 31:00.982
since, like yesterday,
I think it was.

31:01.316 --> 31:02.733
We got a lot in common.

31:03.234 --> 31:04.944
I never really knew
my father either.

31:09.991 --> 31:11.159
[BOTH GRUNTING]

31:11.700 --> 31:13.661
Okay, so why are you
making surfboards

31:13.744 --> 31:14.787
in the middle
of the jungle anyway?

31:14.870 --> 31:17.499
I'm just trying to understand.
I don't get it, you know.

31:17.582 --> 31:18.707
Kid, forget the 20 questions.

31:19.041 --> 31:20.918
Let's just get
the board made, hm?

31:21.419 --> 31:22.462
Okay, it's just...

31:23.630 --> 31:26.341
Are you a surfer, or do you...
I mean, what are you...

31:26.424 --> 31:27.342
[GRUNTS]

31:27.550 --> 31:28.468
[GEEK CHUCKLING]

31:28.551 --> 31:29.469
Ha-ha. Very funny.

31:29.552 --> 31:31.387
Less talk, more
pushing, come on.

31:32.430 --> 31:34.349
Why are we pushing it?
Why don't we just roll it?

31:34.432 --> 31:35.642
- Because... Ow!
- [CRUNCH]

31:35.724 --> 31:36.892
Oh, I'm sorry.
I didn't mean it...

31:36.976 --> 31:37.977
I didn't know
your foot was there.

31:38.060 --> 31:39.145
Are you okay? I'm sorry.

31:39.228 --> 31:40.104
- [CRUNCH]
- Ow!

31:40.188 --> 31:42.398
I'm sorry. It's not like
I intentionally did it, okay.

31:42.482 --> 31:43.774
- I'm sorry.
- Hey, whoa!

31:44.817 --> 31:45.652
[GEEK]
Hey!

31:45.860 --> 31:47.445
- Cody, Cody, the log.
- Yeah, I know!

31:49.614 --> 31:51.574
Wait for...
Geek! Stop, stop!

31:51.658 --> 31:53.618
- Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop!
- Cody!

31:53.784 --> 31:55.328
Cody, grab the vine.

31:55.578 --> 31:56.663
Grab, grab the vine!

31:56.745 --> 31:57.788
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

31:57.872 --> 31:58.831
[GRUNTING]

31:59.081 --> 31:59.957
Now, pull it.

32:00.375 --> 32:01.334
I'm trying!

32:01.792 --> 32:02.918
Pull!

32:03.002 --> 32:04.920
[GRUNTING]

32:06.297 --> 32:07.423
[GRUNTING]

32:07.632 --> 32:09.884
Ah! Cody!
[SCREAMS]

32:10.926 --> 32:11.802
Geek!

32:12.803 --> 32:13.680
Cody!

32:15.139 --> 32:17.099
[GEEK SCREAMING]

32:17.183 --> 32:18.184
Geek!

32:19.768 --> 32:20.769
[THUD]

32:21.187 --> 32:23.189
Oh. Oh, no, no, no,
no, no, no.

32:23.272 --> 32:24.315
[GASPS]

32:24.399 --> 32:25.400
[BOTH SIGH]

32:25.650 --> 32:27.902
Help me up, so...
So I can kick your butt.

32:27.985 --> 32:29.028
[LAUGHS]
Let's go.

32:29.904 --> 32:32.657
I thought you... I thought I
killed you. I didn't... You okay?

32:32.740 --> 32:34.243
Next time, when I say
don't roll the...

32:34.326 --> 32:36.245
No, no. Wha...
Hey, what's that? What's that?

32:39.206 --> 32:40.290
Yeah, it's a beach.

32:41.458 --> 32:42.710
Sand, water, sun.

32:43.419 --> 32:44.587
You seen one, you seen them all.

32:44.670 --> 32:46.046
Come on.
Let's get outta here.

32:46.129 --> 32:47.423
No, no, come on, man.
Let's go check it out.

32:47.506 --> 32:48.424
- [CRUNCH]
- Ow!

32:49.216 --> 32:50.050
[YELLS]

32:50.926 --> 32:52.428
[GEEK GRUNTING]

32:53.721 --> 32:55.639
[INTERVIEWER] So you think
Cody and the Geek are doing all right?

32:55.723 --> 32:58.892
Yeah, yeah I hate to see him
living out there all alone.

32:58.975 --> 33:00.561
It'll be good for him
to have something to do.

33:01.353 --> 33:03.480
[GEEK GRUNTING]

33:13.449 --> 33:15.951
Hey. Somebody's
old board shack.

33:24.209 --> 33:25.377
Look at this.

33:29.214 --> 33:30.507
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

33:31.841 --> 33:33.009
These are Big Z's boards.

33:34.303 --> 33:35.471
Yeah, these are Big Z's boards.

33:35.554 --> 33:37.055
He rode this
in the Australian Open.

33:37.389 --> 33:38.432
[LAUGHING]

33:40.100 --> 33:42.519
This is the board he rode
when he came to Shiverpool, man.

33:42.978 --> 33:45.272
This, I-I ca...

33:45.355 --> 33:47.608
Geek!
This is Big Z's place, man.

33:48.024 --> 33:49.109
This is where he lived!

33:49.192 --> 33:50.569
This is where
he made his boards!

33:50.902 --> 33:52.195
Did you know this was here?

33:53.113 --> 33:54.281
Why didn't you wanna
come down here?

33:54.364 --> 33:55.616
[CODY]
And then he, uh...

33:55.907 --> 33:57.785
He went up
to this old shack, you know.

34:10.673 --> 34:11.923
[PLAYS PEACEFUL RIFF]

34:12.508 --> 34:13.425
And...

34:13.842 --> 34:15.719
I realized, you know...

34:16.928 --> 34:18.054
it was Z.

34:41.996 --> 34:43.914
I could tell
he needed some space

34:43.998 --> 34:45.458
and, you know,
some time to himself.

34:45.792 --> 34:47.918
I didn't wanna, you know,
ask him all these questions,

34:48.002 --> 34:49.462
so... just kind of

34:49.629 --> 34:50.797
stood there quietly.

34:50.880 --> 34:51.964
You're Big Z!

34:52.048 --> 34:53.466
[LAUGHING]
I can't believe it.

34:53.550 --> 34:55.301
You're alive!
You're alive!

34:55.552 --> 34:57.345
That's the respectful way to go,
I think.

34:57.595 --> 34:58.971
Why are you alive?
What happened?

34:59.055 --> 35:00.056
Tell me.
Tell me everything.

35:00.139 --> 35:01.474
Start at the beginning
and just go. Tell me.

35:01.558 --> 35:03.476
- Kid, kid! You'll hurt yourself. Relax.
- Yeah.

35:03.560 --> 35:04.602
But you were dead. Right?

35:04.769 --> 35:06.437
And people said you were dead.

35:06.521 --> 35:08.314
But you're not dead,
you're in hiding. Ha!

35:08.732 --> 35:10.941
Did something happen? Something
happened. You saw something.

35:11.025 --> 35:12.902
You saw something
you weren't supposed to see.

35:12.985 --> 35:14.028
I knew it!
That's what happened!

35:14.111 --> 35:16.823
What, are you nuts? It's not
a conspiracy. It's no big deal.

35:17.073 --> 35:17.990
Oh, what happened?

35:18.658 --> 35:19.950
I don't wanna talk about it.

35:23.621 --> 35:25.122
Okay, you don't...
Okay, I got it.

35:25.206 --> 35:26.708
I'll be over here
if you need anything,

35:26.791 --> 35:30.336
or, you know, you just feel like
talking, or, you know, whatever.

35:30.420 --> 35:32.630
Do you feel it now?
Like talking now?

35:32.756 --> 35:33.673
Go away.

35:33.757 --> 35:35.633
Got it. All right.
I'm going away. I'm go...

35:35.717 --> 35:36.967
Unless, I mean, you...

35:37.093 --> 35:38.386
- Cody!
- Okay, got it. Okay.

35:38.553 --> 35:40.555
I'm not gonna lie to you.
This is, like, you know...

35:41.347 --> 35:42.223
It's huge, man.

35:42.306 --> 35:43.767
It changes everything.
It's like it, you know...

35:44.058 --> 35:45.769
The contest is a few days away.

35:45.852 --> 35:47.812
If I can get him to train me,
then that's...

35:48.229 --> 35:49.272
Boom.

35:49.647 --> 35:50.899
I mean,
I could win this with him.

35:51.357 --> 35:52.776
It... I mean, it's my dream,
you know.

35:52.859 --> 35:54.235
And I don't wanna
give up on that dream.

35:54.861 --> 35:57.697
Winners, winners find a way,
no matter what, right?

35:59.240 --> 36:02.034
Mm, a winner is...

36:03.077 --> 36:04.078
- Mmm!
- Um...

36:04.161 --> 36:07.206
They see their goals.
They just go for it.

36:07.290 --> 36:08.625
They're not in it
for the money or the glory.

36:08.708 --> 36:10.334
A winner is...

36:10.418 --> 36:11.753
- Oh! Hey!
- Like...

36:11.836 --> 36:12.879
Hey, hey!

36:12.962 --> 36:15.214
It's the surfer who's out there
having the most fun.

36:15.298 --> 36:16.507
Yep, it's a lot of fun.

36:17.550 --> 36:18.593
Right, no, I get you.

36:18.760 --> 36:20.261
What's winning
without the losers?

36:20.344 --> 36:22.806
They're in it for the joy of it
and the rapture,

36:22.889 --> 36:24.599
and the slow-motion
instant replay, which is my...

36:24.682 --> 36:26.225
Mikey, why don't you
head over to the snack bar,

36:26.309 --> 36:27.644
and get yourself
a big bowl of shut up?

36:28.102 --> 36:30.521
Feels better when there's
a lot of losers around.

36:30.980 --> 36:32.440
Was, was that your question?

36:32.816 --> 36:34.317
Well, a winner is somebody

36:34.400 --> 36:36.945
who doesn't knock me
off my surfboard...

36:37.403 --> 36:40.114
break it when I'm trying
to get some big waves.

36:40.490 --> 36:43.118
Especially Tank.
He is definitely not a winner.

36:43.410 --> 36:46.246
He's a dirty trash can
full of poop.

36:46.789 --> 36:47.665
Yeah, I can't...

36:47.748 --> 36:49.374
I can't remember a time
when I wasn't surfing.

36:50.167 --> 36:51.543
My mom put me right on there.

36:51.919 --> 36:53.963
I think she pooped me out,
just put me right on there.

36:54.045 --> 36:55.714
[INTERVIEWER] What is it
about surfing that you love?

36:56.298 --> 36:58.133
I love being
the center of attention...

36:58.425 --> 37:01.052
because it's really
where I should be.

37:01.637 --> 37:02.638
And, uh...

37:02.805 --> 37:05.432
I love the looks
my ladies give me, you know.

37:06.057 --> 37:08.101
The little glint.
I love that.

37:08.519 --> 37:09.937
I love holding the ladies.

37:10.896 --> 37:11.981
You know what I'm talking about?

37:12.105 --> 37:14.232
[INTERVIEWER]
I think so. Sort of.

37:14.316 --> 37:15.400
Come on, come with me.

37:19.321 --> 37:20.489
Put this curtain in myself.

37:23.074 --> 37:24.117
These are my ladies.

37:26.203 --> 37:27.204
This is Jill.

37:27.454 --> 37:28.747
This is my lady, Amy.

37:29.039 --> 37:29.999
Little Suzie.

37:30.165 --> 37:31.166
Briana.

37:31.416 --> 37:33.168
You know why
we call her Briana, right?

37:33.251 --> 37:34.127
[INTERVIEWER CHUCKLES]
No.

37:34.503 --> 37:36.046
Yeah, it's a long story.

37:36.254 --> 37:37.172
Shaniqua.

37:37.255 --> 37:38.173
Helga.

37:38.256 --> 37:39.174
Miss Kitty.

37:39.257 --> 37:41.092
Jeannie.
I dream of...

37:41.844 --> 37:42.803
Theresa.

37:43.512 --> 37:45.222
This is Theresa right here.

37:46.015 --> 37:48.017
[INTERVIEWER] Now,
is Theresa, is that your...

37:48.099 --> 37:49.226
Dirty girl.

37:49.977 --> 37:50.978
This spot?

37:51.061 --> 37:52.354
This spot is for my...

37:52.437 --> 37:54.815
For my special lady, Lia.

37:55.482 --> 37:56.901
I'm gonna say that
one more time.

37:57.401 --> 37:58.318
Lia.

37:58.402 --> 37:59.862
Oh, yeah.

38:00.612 --> 38:02.406
That's a sweet, sweet lady.

38:02.489 --> 38:04.700
[WOMAN] Tank, are you
polishing your trophies again?

38:05.158 --> 38:06.284
I... I...

38:06.618 --> 38:07.578
Mom, I...

38:07.661 --> 38:10.163
I wasn't polishing.
I was talking to my friends.

38:12.750 --> 38:14.084
I'm gonna be polishing later.

38:15.085 --> 38:17.755
[CAMERAMAN] When's he
coming out? I'm gonna run out of film.

38:17.838 --> 38:19.048
[INTERVIEWER]
Hey, hey! There he is.

38:19.130 --> 38:21.425
Mr. Topanga, could you tell us
why you're not dead?

38:21.508 --> 38:22.426
No!

38:22.676 --> 38:24.511
I am dead. I'm dead.

38:25.888 --> 38:26.889
[CODY YELLING]

38:30.434 --> 38:32.102
What are you doing?

38:33.812 --> 38:35.564
Hey, who said you...

38:35.856 --> 38:38.191
Turn the board around.
Get back here.

38:38.400 --> 38:40.861
No, just come out here
and show me some moves.

38:40.945 --> 38:42.237
- No, no, no.
- Come on!

38:42.362 --> 38:44.281
Why not?
Grab a board and come out.

38:44.364 --> 38:46.993
Hey, you wanna kill yourself,
go ahead, fine with me.

38:47.077 --> 38:48.494
Just don't mess up my board.

38:48.745 --> 38:49.871
How do you turn this thing?

38:49.955 --> 38:51.873
It's not a short board.
Sit back on it.

38:51.957 --> 38:54.084
[WHISTLES] Hey, watch the wave!

38:54.667 --> 38:55.543
[GAGGING]

38:56.628 --> 38:59.965
You mess up my board,
I'm messing up your other foot.

39:00.048 --> 39:02.300
Hey, I'm just trying to ride
this, this...

39:02.717 --> 39:04.176
canoe or whatever it is, okay?

39:04.385 --> 39:06.554
Well, stop trying... so hard.

39:07.138 --> 39:08.014
Just relax.

39:08.389 --> 39:09.641
What do you mean rela...

39:09.724 --> 39:10.892
[SCREAMS]

39:12.644 --> 39:15.187
Long, smooth strokes.

39:15.563 --> 39:17.231
Dig deep.
Dig, come on.

39:17.315 --> 39:18.399
I'm digging, I'm digging!

39:18.483 --> 39:20.110
Keep the nose up.
Keep it up. You're...

39:20.401 --> 39:21.820
Watch it, you're pearling.

39:22.070 --> 39:23.029
[GRUNTING]

39:24.781 --> 39:25.740
[LAUGHING]

39:25.824 --> 39:26.658
[GRUNTS]

39:28.493 --> 39:29.619
What are you doing?

39:30.036 --> 39:31.287
Come on, please?

39:31.871 --> 39:34.290
Z, I can't learn anything
with you on the beach, man.

39:34.373 --> 39:36.835
Well, then you're not
gonna learn anything.

39:37.627 --> 39:38.503
Now, come on in.

39:38.586 --> 39:40.379
Z, I'm not coming in
until you come out.

39:40.964 --> 39:42.548
Oh, you're coming in, all right.

39:43.091 --> 39:44.509
He's not even watching the wave.

39:44.759 --> 39:45.677
[INTERVIEWER]
What wave?

39:45.760 --> 39:46.594
That one.

39:47.345 --> 39:51.599
Five, four, three, two and...

39:52.934 --> 39:53.977
[SCREAMS]

39:59.816 --> 40:01.776
[COUGHING]

40:04.029 --> 40:05.655
Don't touch my stuff, man.

40:05.989 --> 40:06.948
I couldn't help it.

40:07.032 --> 40:08.783
I-I just wanted
to learn from the best.

40:09.075 --> 40:10.118
Yeah, well.

40:11.161 --> 40:12.662
I don't surf anymore, okay?

40:12.745 --> 40:13.621
[COUGHS]
What?

40:13.997 --> 40:15.123
What do you mean
you don't surf...

40:15.206 --> 40:18.001
Hey, hey. You wanna learn
how to surf the right way?

40:18.168 --> 40:19.711
Uh... sure.

40:19.836 --> 40:22.213
Then you gotta make
your own board, all right?

40:22.797 --> 40:24.716
Wha... Wait, just what do
you mean you don't sur...

40:24.799 --> 40:25.633
Can't hear ya.

40:26.759 --> 40:27.844
Can I ask one quest...

40:27.927 --> 40:28.845
We're making a board.

40:28.928 --> 40:30.346
[INTERVIEWER] Could
you tell me about your board?

40:30.429 --> 40:31.347
Um...

40:31.430 --> 40:33.641
I just have a, uh...

40:34.266 --> 40:35.393
palm-tree board.

40:35.476 --> 40:38.437
I would have to say it's not
the nicest board in the world,

40:38.521 --> 40:40.148
but it is a pretty good board.

40:40.565 --> 40:43.317
The ancient Hawaiians believe
that "mana", or heart,

40:43.401 --> 40:45.737
was transferred into
the surfboard as you shaped it.

40:46.487 --> 40:47.530
What are your thoughts on that?

40:48.740 --> 40:49.782
What's up with the hair?

40:50.242 --> 40:51.702
Could fit a whole fish in there.

40:52.285 --> 40:54.955
My dream surfboard.
It's pretty powerful.

40:55.039 --> 40:56.707
You can add a lot
of attachments to it,

40:56.790 --> 40:58.250
like a grenade-launcher
attachment.

40:58.375 --> 40:59.877
Anybody know
whose board this is?

40:59.960 --> 41:01.294
[ROB] Pretty sure
it's the chicken's.

41:01.378 --> 41:02.588
Has anybody seen the chicken?

41:03.089 --> 41:04.173
Cody!

41:05.340 --> 41:06.508
I know he's out here.

41:07.134 --> 41:08.761
I can feel it in my nuggets.

41:09.220 --> 41:11.597
[INTERVIEWER] Aren't
you nervous out in the jungle?

41:11.680 --> 41:12.848
It's kind of dangerous.

41:12.932 --> 41:15.184
Dude, the jungle is the most
peaceful place on the planet.

41:17.561 --> 41:18.520
[INTERVIEWER GRUNTS]

41:22.191 --> 41:23.400
All right, hold it steady.

41:24.110 --> 41:25.111
[CODY]
This is a dream come true.

41:25.652 --> 41:28.655
This is a dream come true,
here to be here with Z, doing this.

41:29.198 --> 41:31.117
- And it's koa wood.
- Where's the, uh...

41:31.200 --> 41:32.910
Which all the best boards
are made from koa wood.

41:33.619 --> 41:34.661
All right, now...

41:35.829 --> 41:38.082
I drew this pattern as a guide.

41:38.457 --> 41:39.666
Now, do you wanna have your...

41:40.500 --> 41:42.335
board with a lot of rocker
or just a little?

41:42.836 --> 41:44.088
- Uh...
- Hm.

41:44.171 --> 41:45.297
I don't know.
I guess I'd like...

41:45.380 --> 41:48.050
Oh. What you, what you want
is something in between.

41:48.134 --> 41:49.676
Trust me.
I'm the expert here, okay?

41:49.760 --> 41:50.636
Okay.

41:50.886 --> 41:51.762
So, um...

41:52.554 --> 41:54.140
here are your shaping tools.

41:55.057 --> 41:56.391
Now, remember,

41:56.642 --> 41:59.311
the board's already
inside there, see, somewhere.

42:00.146 --> 42:01.188
And what you're doing...

42:01.772 --> 42:03.274
is you're trying to find it.

42:03.565 --> 42:04.900
- Reveal it. All right?
- Okay.

42:04.984 --> 42:05.901
All right.

42:06.735 --> 42:07.820
Every carve counts.

42:07.903 --> 42:08.737
[SCOFFS]

42:08.821 --> 42:10.197
Why are you smiling?
Don't smile.

42:10.281 --> 42:11.991
I'm not... I'm not smiling.
I'm just, you know, excited.

42:12.074 --> 42:14.118
This isn't like
hacking a piece of ice.

42:14.326 --> 42:17.079
You know, it takes
patience and finesse.

42:17.163 --> 42:18.205
All right already.
I'm trying...

42:18.289 --> 42:19.790
Can you just
give me the tools, please?

42:19.873 --> 42:20.791
- [SIGHS]
- Sheesh.

42:20.874 --> 42:23.002
- All right, here, take it. Go ahead.
- Okay. Thank you.

42:24.044 --> 42:24.962
Here we go.

42:25.545 --> 42:26.630
What are you doing?

42:26.713 --> 42:27.840
- [GROANS]
- [SIGHS]

42:28.257 --> 42:29.800
You, look, if you're
gonna do it, you do it right.

42:30.550 --> 42:33.262
All right, look.
First of all, with the grain.

42:33.887 --> 42:34.888
With the grain.

42:34.972 --> 42:36.098
You see what I'm doing here?

42:37.183 --> 42:38.433
You let the tool...

42:39.268 --> 42:41.061
do the work.
You see?

42:41.187 --> 42:42.395
Just like you're riding a wave.

42:42.479 --> 42:43.981
You let the wave do the work.

42:44.064 --> 42:45.649
You don't fight the wave.

42:45.732 --> 42:47.901
You can't fight
these big waves, Code.

42:48.694 --> 42:50.154
Long strokes.

42:50.821 --> 42:52.405
Loads of finesse.

42:53.991 --> 42:56.494
Find the board within the tree.

42:56.995 --> 42:58.788
Nice and easy.

42:58.955 --> 43:00.248
Yeah, I got it.

43:00.332 --> 43:01.457
See that? You just...

43:02.876 --> 43:03.710
Just...

43:03.793 --> 43:04.836
Maybe I could do it now, okay?

43:04.919 --> 43:06.004
...move with...

43:07.714 --> 43:08.798
With the...

43:09.174 --> 43:10.133
Can I do it now?

43:10.675 --> 43:11.551
Sh...

43:12.385 --> 43:13.345
[WHISPERS]
Can I do it now?

43:16.890 --> 43:18.016
- Yeah, I...
- [CLEARS THROAT]

43:18.641 --> 43:20.268
...got carried away.
Sorry about that.

43:20.601 --> 43:22.354
- It's your board.
- It's my board.

43:23.437 --> 43:24.898
Okay, with the grain.
I got it.

43:25.106 --> 43:26.358
Don't forget to eyeball it.

43:26.440 --> 43:27.359
- I got it.
- Once in a while.

43:27.441 --> 43:29.277
Okay, long strokes,
with the grain.

43:29.361 --> 43:30.278
Not too long.

43:30.528 --> 43:31.946
[SIGHS]
Here we go.

43:37.160 --> 43:38.203
You're doing it wrong, Cody.

43:38.286 --> 43:39.996
- Will you just let me?
- No, Cody, seriously...

43:40.080 --> 43:42.957
I can't... No finesse when
you're in my face. Okay?

43:43.041 --> 43:44.125
Just let me make the board.

43:45.210 --> 43:46.294
Do you want my help?

43:46.378 --> 43:47.587
Do I? No, I don't
want your help.

43:48.129 --> 43:49.214
I don't want your help.

43:49.672 --> 43:50.798
Oh, you don't want my help?

43:50.882 --> 43:51.758
I don't want your help.

43:51.841 --> 43:53.593
- Oh. All right. Fine.
- Okay?

43:53.927 --> 43:55.053
- Fine.
- I just wanna make my board.

43:55.136 --> 43:57.555
Build the board yourself, man.
All right? Fine.

43:57.638 --> 43:58.806
Thank you. Thank you.

43:58.890 --> 44:01.475
I don't care
what the board looks like.

44:01.601 --> 44:03.061
You're the one
who's gotta ride the thing.

44:03.144 --> 44:04.271
Fine. I'll...
Thank you.

44:06.439 --> 44:07.732
It's in there somewhere.
Go find it.

44:07.815 --> 44:10.026
Gee. Walk over there, please!
Please.

44:11.194 --> 44:12.112
Don't cut yourself.

44:12.195 --> 44:13.154
[SIGHS]

44:13.238 --> 44:14.155
Tsk.

44:14.697 --> 44:16.699
So it's day three, yeah?
I, uh...

44:17.825 --> 44:20.494
I come across Pen Guans.

44:20.620 --> 44:23.581
I'm Chicken Joe. Joseph.
It's long for Joe.

44:23.664 --> 44:24.791
[SPEAKING FOREIGN DIALECT]

44:24.874 --> 44:25.792
Sweet, man.

44:26.000 --> 44:28.544
And, uh, you know,
they treat me as their king

44:28.628 --> 44:30.046
and put me in a hot tub.

44:30.130 --> 44:31.172
[ALL CHANTING]

44:31.256 --> 44:32.632
[JOE] It is, I guess,
their royal hot tub.

44:32.715 --> 44:34.717
[ROCK MUSIC PLAYING]

44:36.510 --> 44:37.637
[ALL YIPPING]

44:46.646 --> 44:47.563
[SNEEZES]

44:47.647 --> 44:48.606
[ALL SNEEZE]

44:49.357 --> 44:50.858
[JOE]
Got kind of hot and steamy.

44:51.359 --> 44:53.861
But really opened up my pores,
you know?

44:56.114 --> 44:57.073
It was kind of cool.

44:57.157 --> 44:59.201
They kind of served me food
while I was in there.

45:00.493 --> 45:02.621
It was like dinner and a show.

45:02.704 --> 45:04.039
[SPEAKING FOREIGN DIALECT]

45:04.706 --> 45:05.833
Yum-yum-yum-yum-yum.

45:06.083 --> 45:07.418
[LAUGHS]
Yum-yum-yum.

45:07.542 --> 45:09.211
Oh, yum-yum.
Yum-yum-yum-yum!

45:09.462 --> 45:10.838
[ALL]
♪ Yum-yum-yum ♪

45:10.921 --> 45:11.839
♪ Yum-yum-yum ♪

45:11.922 --> 45:12.756
♪ Yum-yum-yum-yum-yum ♪

45:12.840 --> 45:13.674
- ♪ Hey! ♪
- Whoo!

45:13.757 --> 45:15.134
As enjoyable as it was,

45:15.217 --> 45:17.261
I still had a vision
of my quest.

45:19.472 --> 45:20.513
Okay, thank you.

45:21.015 --> 45:22.808
See you guys later.
I-I gotta get going.

45:22.891 --> 45:24.018
[ALL CLAMORING]

45:25.102 --> 45:26.519
[INTERVIEWER GRUNTS]
Not again.

45:28.939 --> 45:29.857
You know what else it was?

45:29.940 --> 45:30.983
Look, okay, I had the board.

45:31.066 --> 45:32.567
The board was fine.
The board was great.

45:33.486 --> 45:34.569
[GRUNTING]

45:35.696 --> 45:36.780
- Huh?
- How's it going?

45:36.864 --> 45:38.366
What?
No, it's going great, man.

45:38.615 --> 45:39.532
It's great.

45:39.867 --> 45:41.076
[INTERVIEWER]
It did look a little rough.

45:41.202 --> 45:42.953
A little rough?
The board looked a little...

45:43.037 --> 45:44.663
It's a work in progress, bro.

45:44.830 --> 45:46.874
You think it's good enough
for the big waves?

45:46.957 --> 45:48.667
I-I think it's good enough
for any wave.

45:48.750 --> 45:50.294
Ah. Oh, oh.

45:51.586 --> 45:52.671
Uh, hang on.

45:54.382 --> 45:57.218
Okay, let's say
I'm a big wave, you know?

45:57.301 --> 45:58.927
Hold on.
No, no, no, no.

45:59.011 --> 46:00.721
- Hey, hey, hey, where you...
- Hold on!

46:01.180 --> 46:02.097
Where you goin'?

46:02.181 --> 46:03.598
It's my board, man, all right?

46:03.682 --> 46:05.184
Why don't you take your board

46:05.393 --> 46:06.727
and go try it out?

46:06.810 --> 46:08.437
- That's what I'm... Maybe I will, huh?
- Good.

46:08.521 --> 46:09.855
Piece of junk. Watch!

46:12.191 --> 46:13.526
[BIG Z]
Oh, that was...

46:13.901 --> 46:15.027
Nice ride, man.

46:15.986 --> 46:16.945
Nice ride.

46:17.196 --> 46:18.155
[GRUNTS]

46:18.531 --> 46:20.366
You know, this is
supposed to be fun.

46:20.533 --> 46:22.575
Look, I got three days
until the contest.

46:22.659 --> 46:23.994
I don't have time for fun.

46:24.537 --> 46:26.247
Oh, no time for fun, huh?

46:27.540 --> 46:28.416
Hey, Cody!

46:28.499 --> 46:29.333
What?

46:29.417 --> 46:31.877
Bring me some clams
when you come back!

46:31.960 --> 46:33.462
I'm not coming back!

46:33.546 --> 46:36.090
[CHUCKLES]
Yeah, he'll be back.

46:36.298 --> 46:37.216
No, I won't!

46:37.383 --> 46:38.551
Eh, he'll be back.

46:39.843 --> 46:40.928
Hey, you guys like barbecue?

46:41.011 --> 46:42.346
- [CAMERAMAN] Yeah, sure.
- [INTERVIEWER] Yeah.

46:42.430 --> 46:43.305
Got some wood here.

46:44.348 --> 46:45.433
I wasted my whole day,

46:45.598 --> 46:46.975
and I have nothing
to show for it, which is...

46:47.059 --> 46:47.976
[BOTH YELP]

46:49.144 --> 46:50.020
- [SIGHS]
- Oh.

46:50.521 --> 46:51.522
Lani.

46:52.689 --> 46:55.568
Uh, I was just actually
going to check on you.

46:55.859 --> 46:58.112
- That's why you were... Oh. Yeah, no.
- And the Geek.

46:58.195 --> 46:59.488
- Listen.
- What?

46:59.654 --> 47:01.115
The Geek, Geek is Big Z.

47:01.198 --> 47:02.116
What? I know.

47:02.199 --> 47:03.285
You know?

47:03.368 --> 47:04.911
- How'd you find out?
- We went to the beach.

47:04.994 --> 47:06.455
- You got him down to the beach?
- Yeah.

47:06.538 --> 47:09.374
Well, I've been trying to get Z
out of that tree for ten years,

47:09.458 --> 47:11.460
and you got him all the way
down to the beach in one day?

47:11.543 --> 47:12.461
[CHUCKLES]
Yeah.

47:12.544 --> 47:14.379
This is fantastic!
Woo-hoo!

47:14.463 --> 47:15.589
- [GRUNTS]
- [LAUGHS]

47:15.671 --> 47:17.173
It's amazing!

47:17.424 --> 47:18.341
So, so...

47:18.425 --> 47:19.926
Do you wanna go somewhere fun?

47:20.969 --> 47:24.931
- Uh...
- Do you wanna go somewhere really, really fun?

47:26.057 --> 47:27.058
- Uh, oh...
- Unless you want...

47:27.142 --> 47:28.602
I mean, did you wanna
get back to Big Z?

47:28.684 --> 47:31.187
- I'm sorry, I shouldn't have invited you.
- No, no, no, no, no.

47:31.271 --> 47:32.772
- What? Okay. No?
- No, look, I...

47:32.855 --> 47:34.690
- I wanna have fun.
- Oh, okay.

47:34.774 --> 47:36.151
Do I need, like,
mints or something?

47:36.234 --> 47:37.193
- [LAUGHS]
- You tell me.

47:37.277 --> 47:39.695
- [LANI] No, you won't need mints.
- [CODY] Okay, all right.

47:40.863 --> 47:43.116
[LANI] Z used to carry us up
here on his shoulders, and we'd,

47:43.699 --> 47:44.867
we'd have so much fun.

47:44.951 --> 47:46.495
It's one of
my favorite spots on Pen Gu.

47:46.578 --> 47:47.454
Really?

47:47.537 --> 47:49.247
Boy, to be
eight years old again.

47:49.331 --> 47:50.290
What is this?

47:50.373 --> 47:52.208
Well, you don't wanna
get all cut up, do you?

47:52.292 --> 47:53.918
No, no. What... Hold on.
What are you doing?

47:54.002 --> 47:55.878
No, no, no, no.
I'm outta here.

47:55.962 --> 47:56.879
I'm better off...

47:56.963 --> 47:58.173
- [SCREAMING]
- [LANI] Whooo!

47:58.256 --> 48:00.300
[ROCK MUSIC PLAYING]

48:03.345 --> 48:04.262
[CODY]
No, no, no, no.

48:04.346 --> 48:05.763
Oh, whoa! Whoa!

48:06.473 --> 48:08.141
- Oh!
- Whoo-hoo!

48:08.266 --> 48:10.226
It's going down! No, no, no!

48:11.645 --> 48:13.855
Whoa, whoa! Whoa, whoa, whoa!

48:14.063 --> 48:14.981
This is insane!

48:15.190 --> 48:16.608
Stop fighting it, Cody!

48:16.732 --> 48:18.067
Just let go!

48:20.612 --> 48:21.571
[LANI]
All right!

48:23.114 --> 48:24.366
[CODY]
Whoa!

48:24.740 --> 48:25.699
Whoo-hoo!

48:26.326 --> 48:27.952
Oh, now I'm in front of you now.

48:28.036 --> 48:29.078
[CODY]
What's going on now?

48:29.162 --> 48:30.455
[LANI]
It's not a race!

48:31.498 --> 48:32.457
[CODY]
Whoo-hoo!

48:39.673 --> 48:41.633
Okay, wait, don't take
the left... Cody!

48:41.715 --> 48:43.051
No!

48:43.510 --> 48:45.887
[CODY]
Whoo! Yeah!

48:46.388 --> 48:48.306
[LAUGHS]
Give up, slowpoke!

48:48.390 --> 48:49.516
It's over with now!

48:49.599 --> 48:50.517
Not for long!

48:51.393 --> 48:53.562
Give up now, sucker!
[LAUGHS]

48:56.481 --> 48:57.649
[LAUGHS]

48:57.731 --> 48:58.650
I beat you!

48:58.732 --> 49:01.194
Congratulations, you sure did.

49:01.277 --> 49:03.029
You should probably
get out of there.

49:03.112 --> 49:05.407
Why is that? This stuff is...
Look at me. It's so beautiful.

49:05.490 --> 49:06.950
Look at it.
What is this stuff?

49:07.034 --> 49:08.827
- See those things up above you?
- Uh-huh.

49:08.911 --> 49:10.496
- Um, they're glowworms.
- Right.

49:10.580 --> 49:11.414
So...

49:11.497 --> 49:12.831
you're right beneath them.

49:12.915 --> 49:13.748
Uh-huh.

49:13.832 --> 49:14.833
Yeah, that's poop.

49:15.543 --> 49:17.044
- [GRUNTS]
- [LAUGHING]

49:21.173 --> 49:22.550
[BOTH LAUGHING]

49:24.843 --> 49:26.761
[LANI] You know
how some stinks stink,

49:26.845 --> 49:28.556
and other stinks smell good?

49:28.639 --> 49:30.349
- Yeah.
- This is like a good stink.

49:30.433 --> 49:32.017
[SCOFFS]
A good stink?

49:32.893 --> 49:34.353
Can I tell you
something personal?

49:34.562 --> 49:36.980
We're in the shower together.
You can say whatever you want.

49:37.064 --> 49:37.981
I'm serious.

49:38.857 --> 49:41.485
I'm really, really,
really jealous of you.

49:41.818 --> 49:43.070
[SCOFFS]
Why?

49:43.153 --> 49:44.821
I couldn't get Z off his butt

49:45.197 --> 49:48.659
for the last ten years,
and then you come along, and...

49:49.826 --> 49:51.454
He must really think
a lot of you.

49:52.747 --> 49:53.706
I don't know.

49:54.248 --> 49:55.374
I mean, I've been a jerk to him,

49:55.458 --> 49:56.459
so I don't know what he thinks.

49:56.542 --> 49:57.460
No, you haven't.

49:57.543 --> 49:58.544
I have.
I've been a jerk to him.

49:59.794 --> 50:00.671
I have.

50:00.755 --> 50:01.714
Well, then go...

50:02.047 --> 50:03.299
not be a jerk.

50:03.966 --> 50:05.217
What does it matter to you,
anyways?

50:05.926 --> 50:06.969
He's my uncle.

50:07.386 --> 50:08.638
He's the only family I've got.

50:16.979 --> 50:17.812
[BOTH LAUGH]

50:17.896 --> 50:18.855
Okay.

50:18.939 --> 50:21.066
[REGGAE SONG PLAYING]

50:24.278 --> 50:26.113
[SNORING]

50:35.122 --> 50:35.998
[GRUNTS]

51:17.999 --> 51:18.874
- [SPLAT]
- [GASPS]

51:20.210 --> 51:21.044
Hm.

51:21.919 --> 51:23.254
Z? No.

51:24.214 --> 51:26.591
No. No, no, no.
Don't, don't you do it.

51:26.675 --> 51:27.925
Z, don't do it. No.

51:28.844 --> 51:30.512
- No.
- Let's see here.

51:30.595 --> 51:32.096
I swear, man,
if you break that board...

51:32.180 --> 51:33.640
- It's stronger than I thought.
- If you break it...

51:33.724 --> 51:34.890
Should've been broken by now.

51:36.142 --> 51:37.644
Come on, man!
Come on!

51:37.728 --> 51:38.854
[LAUGHING]

51:42.649 --> 51:43.941
Oh, look at that.

51:45.652 --> 51:49.280
Ah, that's the best place
in the world to be, in the tube.

51:49.614 --> 51:50.532
Really?

51:51.074 --> 51:51.991
Aw, yeah,

51:52.075 --> 51:53.076
better than winning.

51:53.827 --> 51:55.245
The trophy, all that stuff.

51:56.246 --> 51:57.247
[PENGUIN 1]
Tube riding is,

51:57.497 --> 51:59.541
is the ultimate,
ultimate thing in surfing.

51:59.624 --> 52:02.001
To ride inside the wave and,
and make it out of it.

52:02.085 --> 52:03.503
It's all what we want to do
everyday.

52:03.587 --> 52:06.840
[PENGUIN 2] Ah, it's, it's
almost impossible to describe.

52:06.964 --> 52:08.842
There's nothing
I can compare it to.

52:08.924 --> 52:10.926
[PENGUIN 3] It's a
feeling that, um, you know,

52:11.010 --> 52:13.638
you know not too many people
will experience, and, uh,

52:14.055 --> 52:15.807
and, uh, so it's special
in that sense.

52:15.891 --> 52:17.308
[PENGUIN 4] And then
you just try to remember it.

52:17.392 --> 52:19.394
You're like, "Geez, I wish
I could remember that,"

52:19.477 --> 52:20.562
or "I wish I could get
that again."

52:20.645 --> 52:21.563
It's just so addicting.

52:22.606 --> 52:25.442
Ah, once you get inside,
you never wanna get out.

52:26.610 --> 52:27.611
Wow.

52:28.069 --> 52:29.987
- That's amazing.
- Oh, yeah, man.

52:30.071 --> 52:31.322
Nothing like it.

52:32.282 --> 52:34.117
Okay, so that aside,
well, I mean,

52:34.743 --> 52:37.036
how many points
would you get for getting tube?

52:38.079 --> 52:39.915
Like what does it depend on
for the contest?

52:39.997 --> 52:40.916
Points?

52:41.124 --> 52:41.999
[SIGHS]

52:42.083 --> 52:42.958
What?

52:43.042 --> 52:45.211
Do you know, you know
who you sound like right now?

52:45.462 --> 52:47.046
I promote happiness!

52:47.422 --> 52:49.841
Can you see the happiness
emanating from me?

52:49.925 --> 52:50.926
What's wrong with you?

52:51.008 --> 52:52.636
- [INTERVIEWER] Mr. Belafonte?
- [CAMERAMAN] We're live.

52:52.719 --> 52:54.095
Huh? Oh, good. Good.
I have to say...

52:54.345 --> 52:57.474
I have no doubt
that this year's Big Z Memorial

52:57.557 --> 52:59.016
is gonna be just the best ever.

52:59.100 --> 53:00.727
[HAWAIIAN MUSIC PLAYING
OVER SPEAKERS]

53:00.811 --> 53:02.813
[SAL] With the competition
just one day away,

53:02.896 --> 53:07.191
the excitement is definitely
building here on Pen Gu Island.

53:21.290 --> 53:22.207
[VIDEO FAST FORWARDING]

53:22.374 --> 53:23.208
[SNORES]

53:23.292 --> 53:24.209
[BURPS]

53:24.293 --> 53:25.628
[HAWAIIAN SONG PLAYS
IN FAST FORWARD]

53:26.420 --> 53:27.964
[AUDIO SQUEAKING]

53:28.088 --> 53:29.465
Oh, that didn't take too long.

53:29.966 --> 53:30.967
I feel lightheaded.

53:31.717 --> 53:32.635
So get this.

53:33.051 --> 53:34.428
On my search for Cody,

53:34.679 --> 53:36.931
I bump into
my hot-tub buddies again.

53:37.013 --> 53:37.932
[ALL SPEAKING FOREIGN DIALECT]

53:38.516 --> 53:40.518
Oh, I get it.
You guys look hungry.

53:40.601 --> 53:43.270
Yeah, yeah. You've probably
got the munchies or something.

53:43.437 --> 53:44.897
Uno momento.

53:45.982 --> 53:47.775
Squidito on el stickito?

53:47.859 --> 53:48.776
[ALL GASPS]

53:48.860 --> 53:50.486
- [SNIFFS]
- Mmm? Mmm?

53:53.781 --> 53:55.199
[SPEAKS FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

53:55.282 --> 53:56.367
[ALL CHEERING]

53:57.618 --> 53:59.077
Whoa, check it out.

53:59.620 --> 54:01.873
Dude, dude, have you seen
my friend, Cody?

54:01.956 --> 54:03.582
You know, he's kind of
like a penguin.

54:04.000 --> 54:04.917
Um...

54:05.167 --> 54:06.919
He's got a lot of black on him,
a lot of white.

54:07.003 --> 54:08.170
[LAUGHING]
Yum-yum-yum!

54:08.253 --> 54:09.839
[INTERVIEWER] Hey, guys,
how'd you learn how to surf?

54:09.922 --> 54:11.799
I saw Big Z do it, actually.

54:12.424 --> 54:14.050
I don't think you were born yet.

54:14.134 --> 54:16.428
- I wasn't?
- No, I don't think so.

54:16.804 --> 54:17.680
Lani?

54:18.180 --> 54:20.850
I like her when she
teaches us because...

54:20.933 --> 54:21.809
[SNIFFS]

54:21.893 --> 54:23.686
Smudge!
Not another one!

54:23.769 --> 54:25.855
I think he really has to go
to the bathroom right now.

54:26.939 --> 54:27.857
Okay, so, what's next?

54:27.940 --> 54:29.025
The board is done.
What're we doing?

54:29.107 --> 54:30.275
- The board is done?
- The board is done.

54:30.359 --> 54:31.443
Oh, well, uh...

54:31.694 --> 54:33.487
Let's do some training.
What do you say?

54:33.571 --> 54:34.572
Finally!

54:35.071 --> 54:36.240
[INTERVIEWER]
Can we get a shot of you...

54:36.323 --> 54:37.992
No, you gotta get a
long shot, boys. All right.

54:39.035 --> 54:41.286
Hey, Z, come on! Hey.

54:41.746 --> 54:42.580
Where you goin'?

54:42.663 --> 54:43.956
Oh, I thought you said
we were gonna train.

54:44.040 --> 54:45.457
Not in the water.

54:45.791 --> 54:47.209
Jeez, what're you thinking?

54:48.836 --> 54:51.547
- You wanna surf like, uh, Big Z used to, right?
- Yeah.

54:52.048 --> 54:54.800
I've got some tests here
to figure out your potential.

54:54.884 --> 54:55.843
Let's do it.

54:55.927 --> 54:57.344
No, no, no.
Put them on your eyes.

54:57.511 --> 54:58.429
Like this. Yeah.

54:58.512 --> 54:59.430
On my eyes.

55:01.015 --> 55:02.683
[SNICKERS]

55:02.934 --> 55:03.893
Take it, Cody.

55:03.976 --> 55:06.395
Can we do some training,
seriously, please?

55:06.478 --> 55:08.188
What're you talking about?
What do you think we're doing?

55:08.272 --> 55:10.357
We're acting like a bunch of
nutjobs. That's what I think we're doing.

55:10.441 --> 55:11.358
Yeah, good.
You're learning!

55:11.442 --> 55:12.317
[SHRIEKS]

55:13.360 --> 55:14.904
[BIG Z]
And a big set comes in.

55:14.987 --> 55:15.905
[GRUNTS]

55:16.363 --> 55:17.573
[LAUGHS]

55:17.656 --> 55:18.742
Wipeout!

55:19.451 --> 55:20.326
That's it.

55:20.410 --> 55:21.453
- Take it easy.
- That's insane!

55:21.828 --> 55:23.038
This is getting ridiculous.

55:23.496 --> 55:25.040
- You having fun?
- I hate you.

55:25.248 --> 55:27.459
[IMITATES WATER SPLASHING]
Big, you know, slow...

55:27.542 --> 55:29.294
[IMITATES WATER SPLASHING]
Yoo-hoo!

55:29.628 --> 55:31.170
And he does this flip
over the top.

55:31.379 --> 55:32.380
All right, now you go.

55:32.672 --> 55:33.590
Look, and...

55:33.673 --> 55:34.633
Ooh, whoo.

55:34.716 --> 55:36.175
No joy, man. No joy.

55:36.718 --> 55:37.636
Failed.

55:37.886 --> 55:39.805
Whew. I'm starting
to see it, man.

55:41.180 --> 55:42.557
Z, I think I know
what you're talking about.

55:42.641 --> 55:43.558
[MEN LAUGHING]

55:44.225 --> 55:45.268
Oh, well, this...
That's great.

55:45.351 --> 55:46.311
[CAMERAMAN]
Sorry, man.

55:46.394 --> 55:47.604
As long as we're all
having fun, right?

55:47.687 --> 55:49.188
Z, wake up. Wake up, Z.

55:49.272 --> 55:50.189
[MUMBLES]

55:50.356 --> 55:51.858
Z!

55:51.984 --> 55:53.568
[SNORING]

56:00.366 --> 56:02.077
Hey, Z, breakfast!

56:02.702 --> 56:03.787
[GRUNTS]

56:04.245 --> 56:05.413
Not a chance.

56:06.247 --> 56:07.082
Four...

56:07.164 --> 56:08.416
You gotta get up earlier
in the morning.

56:08.500 --> 56:09.793
three, two...

56:09.876 --> 56:10.710
[YELPS]

56:10.794 --> 56:11.795
one.

56:12.169 --> 56:14.339
[CODY LAUGHING]

56:20.470 --> 56:21.554
That is fun. That...

56:21.638 --> 56:23.765
- Oh, you're having fun, huh?
- I am. Yes. Now I am.

56:23.849 --> 56:24.683
Oh.

56:24.766 --> 56:27.310
Oh, well, then, Cody,
you passed!

56:27.393 --> 56:29.354
- What?
- You did it! You're ready!

56:29.437 --> 56:30.689
Let's surf! Come on!

56:30.772 --> 56:31.773
Z, don't play with me, Z.

56:31.857 --> 56:32.732
- We're surfing?
- Whoo-hoo!

56:32.858 --> 56:34.151
Yes! Yes!

56:34.233 --> 56:35.192
[LAUGHING]

56:35.276 --> 56:36.153
Okay.

56:36.235 --> 56:38.822
[UPBEAT SONG PLAYING]

56:45.037 --> 56:45.996
Yeah.

56:46.454 --> 56:47.413
Hey, check it... Oh!

56:51.001 --> 56:52.044
[LAUGHS]

56:54.253 --> 56:55.922
Hey, I didn't know
you could surf!

57:01.803 --> 57:03.471
- Wh-wh-wh-whoa.
- Relax.

57:04.097 --> 57:07.600
Long, slow, smooth.

57:07.684 --> 57:09.561
- Like making the board!
- There you go.

57:09.811 --> 57:11.897
- All right. Okay.
- Feels good, yeah?

57:11.980 --> 57:12.856
Yeah!

57:21.907 --> 57:22.992
[BIG Z AND CODY]
Lani!

57:24.035 --> 57:25.536
You're in the water, Z!

57:25.619 --> 57:28.206
[BIG Z] Come on out.
Get wet! Come on!

57:33.377 --> 57:34.378
Lani...

57:35.295 --> 57:36.214
thank you.

57:41.052 --> 57:41.928
[CODY]
Whoo!

57:43.221 --> 57:44.471
Look at that!

57:44.555 --> 57:45.389
[LAUGHS]

57:50.811 --> 57:52.230
[SONG CONTINUES]

57:57.610 --> 57:59.862
- Whoo! Great ride!
- Nice! That's it!

58:00.238 --> 58:01.155
[BIG Z]
Nice job.

58:26.847 --> 58:28.515
- Big Z is back!
- Whoo!

58:32.103 --> 58:33.062
Whoo-hoo!

58:38.358 --> 58:39.443
[SIGHS]

58:39.986 --> 58:41.695
This is what it's all about.

58:43.322 --> 58:44.698
What could be better than this?

58:54.500 --> 58:55.960
[PLAYS CHEERFUL MELODY]

58:56.043 --> 58:58.171
♪ Hey, it's impossible ♪

58:58.254 --> 59:00.131
♪ To be down ♪

59:00.339 --> 59:01.548
Oh, jeez.

59:01.632 --> 59:02.633
[SCOFFS]

59:02.716 --> 59:04.885
♪ When you're playing ♪

59:04.969 --> 59:10.683
♪ A uke ♪

59:12.768 --> 59:13.811
[HIGH VOICE]
I need some help, Lani,

59:13.894 --> 59:15.395
on this landing
for the high note.

59:15.479 --> 59:19.025
[ALL]
♪ Ooh ♪

59:19.108 --> 59:21.443
Yay! Nice. Nice.

59:21.527 --> 59:23.070
[ALL LAUGH]

59:23.154 --> 59:24.571
Is that the only song
that you know?

59:24.655 --> 59:25.823
Pretty much.
You wanna here it again?

59:25.906 --> 59:27.284
- [BOTH] No, no, no.
- It goes like this...

59:27.367 --> 59:28.869
No? No, okay.

59:29.328 --> 59:30.537
Got you there, didn't I?

59:30.620 --> 59:33.748
I must say you were
quite amazing out there today.

59:34.541 --> 59:36.335
You weren't
so bad yourself, kiddo.

59:36.417 --> 59:37.418
Thanks to this guy.

59:37.878 --> 59:39.462
Nah, I just pointed you
in a direction.

59:41.340 --> 59:42.382
Question, Z.

59:42.883 --> 59:43.925
[BIG Z]
Hm?

59:44.051 --> 59:45.177
You changed your mind
about the song.

59:45.260 --> 59:46.136
No, no, no.
No, no.

59:46.220 --> 59:47.679
I got it. Here it goes.
Something like this.

59:47.762 --> 59:50.057
I was wondering if you'd come
watch me ride tomorrow.

59:50.557 --> 59:51.892
- ♪ This ukelele ♪
- Z!

59:52.100 --> 59:54.435
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
We'll both ride, man.

59:54.519 --> 59:56.813
No, no, no. Not just...
In the contest.

59:57.605 --> 59:58.899
Contest? What contest?

59:59.316 --> 01:00:01.318
The Big Z Memorial.
You remember that one?

01:00:01.818 --> 01:00:03.444
I mean, I know,
I know I'm asking a lot,

01:00:03.528 --> 01:00:05.446
- but it would really, really be...
- [SIGHS]

01:00:05.530 --> 01:00:08.075
the biggest thing
in the world to me

01:00:08.158 --> 01:00:09.326
if you could come.
I mean...

01:00:11.452 --> 01:00:12.829
You still wanna be a part
of all that?

01:00:13.205 --> 01:00:14.164
Absolutely.

01:00:15.249 --> 01:00:16.624
Well, what do you
want me there for, anyway?

01:00:16.708 --> 01:00:18.626
I know, I thought maybe
you'd wanna be there.

01:00:18.710 --> 01:00:20.295
I mean, I don't know
why it's a big deal.

01:00:20.379 --> 01:00:21.338
It's no big deal.

01:00:22.463 --> 01:00:23.548
[SIGHS]
Why won't you come?

01:00:24.383 --> 01:00:25.300
[CHUCKLES]
I'm not coming.

01:00:25.384 --> 01:00:26.260
Why?

01:00:26.343 --> 01:00:28.095
- Just give, give it a rest.
- It's getting cold, guys.

01:00:28.178 --> 01:00:29.304
Can you tell me
why you're hiding.

01:00:29.388 --> 01:00:30.680
- Hiding?
- Why are you hiding?

01:00:30.764 --> 01:00:32.432
[LANI]
I'll have to eat this by myself.

01:00:32.515 --> 01:00:34.684
Why didn't you come back
after you fell off the wave?

01:00:35.727 --> 01:00:36.644
That wave.

01:00:37.896 --> 01:00:38.939
[SIGHS]

01:00:39.856 --> 01:00:41.024
[BIG Z]
That last day,

01:00:41.482 --> 01:00:42.401
winning...

01:00:43.151 --> 01:00:44.778
had become everything to me.

01:00:45.112 --> 01:00:46.696
I knew I was gonna beat Tank.

01:00:48.073 --> 01:00:49.824
But then, uh, you know,

01:00:50.242 --> 01:00:51.326
he starts to...

01:00:52.202 --> 01:00:53.494
surf circles around me.

01:00:54.162 --> 01:00:55.372
I saw what he was doing.

01:00:55.455 --> 01:00:56.831
I couldn't do what he was doing.

01:00:57.999 --> 01:00:59.834
Times had changed,
you know. He...

01:01:00.085 --> 01:01:01.128
[SIGHS]

01:01:01.544 --> 01:01:03.213
I didn't wanna walk back
on that beach

01:01:03.297 --> 01:01:04.798
with all my fans there,
you know.

01:01:04.881 --> 01:01:06.967
A loser. Everyone
looking at Big Z, the...

01:01:07.217 --> 01:01:08.676
The loser, the has-been.

01:01:09.844 --> 01:01:10.762
So...

01:01:14.224 --> 01:01:15.600
[SIGHS]

01:01:16.559 --> 01:01:17.518
Poof.

01:01:19.562 --> 01:01:20.563
Big Z's dead,

01:01:20.647 --> 01:01:21.982
and that's how it's gonna stay.

01:01:23.233 --> 01:01:24.276
Let me play you that song.

01:01:24.359 --> 01:01:25.526
[PLAYING CHEERFUL MELODY]

01:01:25.610 --> 01:01:27.528
Wha... What about
"never give up"?

01:01:27.612 --> 01:01:28.529
[SIGHS]

01:01:28.613 --> 01:01:29.530
What about "find a way"?

01:01:29.614 --> 01:01:30.449
Yeah, well...

01:01:30.531 --> 01:01:31.784
You're giving up, Z.
You're giving up.

01:01:31.867 --> 01:01:34.203
Yeah. I'm giving up.
That's my way.

01:01:34.287 --> 01:01:35.121
[SCOFFS]

01:01:35.204 --> 01:01:36.080
Giving up.

01:01:36.331 --> 01:01:37.539
I thought you were the one guy.

01:01:38.707 --> 01:01:40.501
You don't like it,
find your own way.

01:01:43.421 --> 01:01:44.546
Leave me out of it.

01:01:45.631 --> 01:01:46.507
Leave me out of it.

01:01:47.383 --> 01:01:48.301
Z!

01:01:48.926 --> 01:01:51.095
[SLOW SONG PLAYING]

01:01:53.764 --> 01:01:54.765
[GRUNTS]

01:02:14.827 --> 01:02:16.829
[CODY]
I messed up. I'm just...

01:02:17.497 --> 01:02:19.415
I'm... not good.

01:02:20.082 --> 01:02:22.043
This is when I needed someone.
I needed him.

01:02:23.711 --> 01:02:25.004
You know, it's...
I mean, if...

01:02:25.087 --> 01:02:26.339
It's hard enough
losing one dad, but...

01:02:27.756 --> 01:02:29.217
- [INTERVIEWER] What do you mean by that?
- Nothing.

01:02:30.426 --> 01:02:32.053
Nothing, man. Forget it.

01:02:43.147 --> 01:02:44.106
[SCREAMS]

01:02:44.190 --> 01:02:45.483
Oh! Whoa, whoa!

01:02:45.566 --> 01:02:46.859
[ALL CLAMORING]

01:02:47.318 --> 01:02:49.611
Peaceful, peaceful.
I'm in peace. I come in peace.

01:02:49.695 --> 01:02:50.946
- Cody!
- Joe!

01:02:51.197 --> 01:02:53.115
[SIGHS] I've been
looking everywhere for you.

01:02:53.199 --> 01:02:54.492
Really? You've been
looking for me?

01:02:54.575 --> 01:02:56.077
Dude, I didn't lose you
on the whale.

01:02:56.160 --> 01:02:57.370
I'm not gonna lose you now.

01:02:57.745 --> 01:02:58.996
Thank you.
Seriously, thank you.

01:02:59.080 --> 01:03:00.373
- [PEN GUAN] Yum-yum.
- Radical.

01:03:01.416 --> 01:03:02.666
- [HORN BLARES]
- [GASPS]

01:03:02.917 --> 01:03:04.293
Oh, they're, they're starting.

01:03:04.377 --> 01:03:05.586
Cody, we gotta go!
Come on!

01:03:06.212 --> 01:03:08.506
Wait a minute. Joe? Joe?

01:03:09.006 --> 01:03:10.716
Oh, I'm sorry.
Watch this, dude.

01:03:10.841 --> 01:03:11.926
I can speak their language.

01:03:12.009 --> 01:03:13.553
Mondo cudo pungu.

01:03:14.303 --> 01:03:15.179
[YELLS]

01:03:16.055 --> 01:03:17.598
Dude, I totally need my board.

01:03:17.681 --> 01:03:19.225
I don't even know where
it is. I gotta go find it.

01:03:19.308 --> 01:03:20.560
I'll see you in the lineup then.

01:03:20.893 --> 01:03:21.810
See you, Joe.

01:03:21.894 --> 01:03:23.438
[JOE] This is gonna
be fun, huh? Whoo.

01:03:23.521 --> 01:03:24.355
[PEN GUAN]
See ya!

01:03:25.940 --> 01:03:29.735
[SAL] The tenth annual Big Z
is about to get underway,

01:03:29.818 --> 01:03:32.613
and, whoa,
it is the day of days.

01:03:32.696 --> 01:03:35.909
Big mountainous bombs
marching into our coastline.

01:03:36.201 --> 01:03:38.203
Kelly Slater, on a danger level,

01:03:38.287 --> 01:03:39.955
one to ten, give me a number.

01:03:40.205 --> 01:03:41.123
Twenty.

01:03:41.206 --> 01:03:42.291
Wow. Rob?

01:03:42.374 --> 01:03:43.333
Oh, there'll be blood.

01:03:43.417 --> 01:03:45.294
I'm scared,
and I'm in the booth!

01:03:46.336 --> 01:03:47.463
What're you doing here?

01:03:48.213 --> 01:03:49.590
- Mike.
- You're gonna kill yourself.

01:03:49.672 --> 01:03:51.049
Please don't do this
to yourself. Please.

01:03:51.133 --> 01:03:52.384
Look what happened last time.
Look...

01:03:52.468 --> 01:03:53.385
- Agh!
- Hey, hey, hey.

01:03:53.469 --> 01:03:55.429
- Good to see you back.
- Are you serious?

01:03:55.512 --> 01:03:56.930
You know, you're gonna be
a real crowd pleaser.

01:03:57.013 --> 01:03:57.931
I'm telling ya.

01:03:58.014 --> 01:03:59.600
These people
are gonna eat you up.

01:03:59.682 --> 01:04:01.893
I'll be expecting big things
from you.

01:04:01.977 --> 01:04:02.811
Thank you.

01:04:03.437 --> 01:04:05.814
[REGGIE OVER MEGAPHONE] Hey, people,
big announcement, Cody Maverick, he's back.

01:04:05.897 --> 01:04:07.316
The Wipeout King is back.

01:04:07.399 --> 01:04:09.651
And I'm gonna tell you,
start looking for the sharks.

01:04:09.734 --> 01:04:11.861
They'll be circling 'cause
there'll be blood in the water.

01:04:11.945 --> 01:04:13.196
Spectacular carnage today.

01:04:13.280 --> 01:04:14.823
Thank you.
Reggie Belafonte. Hey.

01:04:14.906 --> 01:04:17.159
Little guy, big hair, big
thoughts, big heart. Come on.

01:04:23.915 --> 01:04:25.208
[CROWD CHEERING]

01:04:25.292 --> 01:04:27.336
Oh-ho-ho.
Look at this.

01:04:28.044 --> 01:04:29.879
You're goin' down, snowflake.

01:04:31.507 --> 01:04:33.675
I'm gonna make you wish
you were never even hatched.

01:04:35.927 --> 01:04:37.262
You wanna see my trophies?

01:04:38.221 --> 01:04:39.264
[HORN BLARES]

01:04:39.348 --> 01:04:40.849
[CROWD CHEERING]

01:04:44.853 --> 01:04:45.812
Whoo!

01:04:46.062 --> 01:04:47.147
[PANTING]

01:04:47.230 --> 01:04:49.065
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Arnold, no.

01:04:49.149 --> 01:04:50.108
[GROANS]

01:04:52.235 --> 01:04:53.236
Yeah!

01:04:55.905 --> 01:04:58.617
[SAL] About 24 surfers
battling their way out to the...

01:04:58.825 --> 01:05:01.036
Ooh! Good golly.

01:05:01.119 --> 01:05:02.787
Make that 18.

01:05:05.957 --> 01:05:08.585
Rob, after such a heavy wipeout
earlier in the week,

01:05:08.751 --> 01:05:10.587
what do you think is going
through Maverick's mind?

01:05:10.671 --> 01:05:12.172
[ROB] He's gonna have
to stay focused

01:05:12.255 --> 01:05:14.466
and channel that energy
into good places.

01:05:15.091 --> 01:05:16.468
When are you gonna get a life?

01:05:17.093 --> 01:05:18.387
[PANTING]

01:05:18.928 --> 01:05:20.430
You are a nobody.

01:05:22.140 --> 01:05:24.142
You should've stayed
in Antarctica, kid.

01:05:24.767 --> 01:05:25.686
[GRUNTS]

01:05:27.479 --> 01:05:28.689
Whoa!

01:05:35.737 --> 01:05:37.280
[PANTING]

01:05:44.163 --> 01:05:45.456
Cody, Cody, Cody!

01:05:46.916 --> 01:05:47.791
Whoo!

01:05:48.792 --> 01:05:51.588
Oh, he made it! He...
That... Yeah, good.

01:05:51.879 --> 01:05:55.550
[SAL] What an amazing first
ride mind-blower from Maverick.

01:06:01.472 --> 01:06:02.682
[CHUCKLES]
Did you guys see that?

01:06:03.391 --> 01:06:05.017
Oh, man, I...
You know, I...

01:06:05.101 --> 01:06:06.477
I thought I was gonna lose it,
then I just...

01:06:07.270 --> 01:06:08.979
Whew. I just let go, you know.

01:06:09.063 --> 01:06:10.356
You know, I let go,
and there it was.

01:06:10.440 --> 01:06:11.774
[UPBEAT THEME PLAYING]

01:06:11.857 --> 01:06:13.984
[SAL]
Wow, it's been an amazing day

01:06:14.068 --> 01:06:16.904
of shredding in
less than stellar conditions,

01:06:17.113 --> 01:06:19.574
but I never would've guessed
our three finalists.

01:06:19.949 --> 01:06:22.493
Well, Sal, it's no surprise
that Tank Evans

01:06:22.577 --> 01:06:24.621
has just breezed his way
into the finals.

01:06:25.622 --> 01:06:26.706
[KELLY]
And Cody Maverick,

01:06:26.789 --> 01:06:29.333
from a horrible wipeout
a few days ago to this.

01:06:32.336 --> 01:06:35.131
[ROB] And Chicken Joe from
Sheboygan. Who would've guessed it?

01:06:35.839 --> 01:06:37.800
[SAL IN SING SONG VOICE]
I have never

01:06:37.883 --> 01:06:39.302
seen a finals like this.

01:06:40.595 --> 01:06:41.596
We're in the finals, Joe.

01:06:41.679 --> 01:06:43.097
No way! We get
to surf some more?

01:06:43.180 --> 01:06:44.348
- Isn't it exciting?
- Yeah.

01:06:44.432 --> 01:06:45.725
Look at that. Ha-ha!

01:06:45.808 --> 01:06:46.768
- Huh?
- This is great, huh?

01:06:46.850 --> 01:06:48.311
Hey, you know,
you should know this,

01:06:48.478 --> 01:06:50.271
Tank loves you.

01:06:51.188 --> 01:06:53.190
Looks like this'll be
the easiest year ever.

01:06:53.274 --> 01:06:54.275
[LAUGHS]

01:06:54.358 --> 01:06:55.985
Oh, no way.
Cody, did you hear that?

01:06:56.068 --> 01:06:57.861
It's gonna be easy.
[CHUCKLES]

01:06:58.237 --> 01:07:01.115
Are you loving this?

01:07:01.198 --> 01:07:02.492
[ALL CHEERING]

01:07:02.575 --> 01:07:03.451
Yeah!

01:07:03.576 --> 01:07:05.328
[INTERVIEWER] So who would
you like to see win the trophy?

01:07:05.411 --> 01:07:07.871
It's not so important to me.

01:07:07.955 --> 01:07:10.916
- [HICCUPS] - Friends are
better than anything in the world.

01:07:11.000 --> 01:07:11.917
Friends are forever.

01:07:12.001 --> 01:07:14.044
Trophies, never know
what they can have ha...

01:07:14.128 --> 01:07:16.005
- [HICCUPS]
- Happen to them.

01:07:16.088 --> 01:07:17.089
[HICCUPS]

01:07:17.590 --> 01:07:19.550
- That was awesome, mate.
- Thank you, man.

01:07:19.634 --> 01:07:20.884
Muy impressivo, my friend.

01:07:20.968 --> 01:07:21.885
Thank you, bro.
Thank you.

01:07:21.969 --> 01:07:23.429
- Wow. Finals.
- Hey!

01:07:24.347 --> 01:07:27.141
Yeah. No, I know.
It's... I can't even...

01:07:27.684 --> 01:07:29.310
I know, I think I can win
this thing, it's just...

01:07:29.393 --> 01:07:30.394
It's too much right now,
you know.

01:07:30.478 --> 01:07:32.021
Yeah, well,
that's all you came for.

01:07:32.104 --> 01:07:33.022
What?

01:07:33.481 --> 01:07:34.565
What was that supposed to mean?

01:07:34.649 --> 01:07:36.484
You made it
pretty clear last night

01:07:36.567 --> 01:07:38.361
that winning's more important
to you than Z or me.

01:07:38.444 --> 01:07:39.529
- Lani, that's not...
- But hey,

01:07:39.612 --> 01:07:41.113
maybe you'll get to take
your stupid trophy home.

01:07:41.197 --> 01:07:43.116
- Lani, come on.
- Come here, you!

01:07:43.200 --> 01:07:44.284
[CAMERAS CLICKING]

01:07:44.368 --> 01:07:45.285
How about this, huh?

01:07:45.786 --> 01:07:46.829
Lemme tell you something.

01:07:46.911 --> 01:07:47.912
You win this thing,

01:07:47.996 --> 01:07:49.540
you and me, we're going places.

01:07:49.623 --> 01:07:50.874
Huh? Hey!

01:07:51.082 --> 01:07:52.334
Look at this kid.

01:07:52.417 --> 01:07:54.252
- [ALL CHEERING]
- He is a champ.

01:07:55.920 --> 01:07:56.880
[HORN BLARES]

01:07:58.674 --> 01:08:01.051
[PENGUIN] Chicken Joe,
you're the bro. Woo-hoo!

01:08:03.512 --> 01:08:06.223
Tank, nine-time
defending champion.

01:08:06.515 --> 01:08:07.766
He will roll on you.

01:08:07.850 --> 01:08:09.267
[KELLY] Expecting him
to win this thing, Sal.

01:08:09.351 --> 01:08:10.644
It's basically a contest
for second place.

01:08:11.645 --> 01:08:13.438
First, I'm gonna take you down.

01:08:13.731 --> 01:08:15.273
Then I'm gonna fry the chicken.

01:08:16.817 --> 01:08:18.694
- [JOE GASPS]
- What?

01:08:18.777 --> 01:08:20.738
That cloud looks
just like a kitten.

01:08:21.112 --> 01:08:21.988
Aw.

01:08:28.412 --> 01:08:29.621
[HORN BLARES]

01:08:29.705 --> 01:08:32.750
[ROCK SONG PLAYING]

01:08:34.835 --> 01:08:36.378
[SAL]
Maverick and Evans take off.

01:08:37.379 --> 01:08:38.296
Mine!

01:08:38.380 --> 01:08:40.841
And it's Evans droppin' in!

01:08:42.092 --> 01:08:43.134
[GRUNTS]

01:08:43.594 --> 01:08:46.513
And Tank's playing games,
blocking Maverick's every move.

01:08:46.722 --> 01:08:47.890
[YELPING]

01:08:47.972 --> 01:08:49.099
But Maverick sticks a rail!

01:08:50.308 --> 01:08:51.602
Tank Evans down!

01:08:51.685 --> 01:08:52.519
[SCREAMS]

01:08:52.603 --> 01:08:54.479
I have never,
ever seen this before!

01:08:54.563 --> 01:08:55.397
[ALL GASPS]

01:08:55.480 --> 01:08:56.565
[ALL CHEERING]

01:08:56.899 --> 01:08:58.859
But I'd love to see it again.

01:08:59.025 --> 01:09:01.152
Cody trying
to take back the wave

01:09:01.236 --> 01:09:02.487
that Tank snaked from him.

01:09:02.571 --> 01:09:04.823
Evans toying with him,
not paying attention.

01:09:04.907 --> 01:09:07.284
And there's the outside rail.
Evans goes down.

01:09:07.367 --> 01:09:10.495
And it's Maverick
with this new-school move.

01:09:10.579 --> 01:09:11.789
We'll call it The Maverick.

01:09:13.248 --> 01:09:14.165
[SPITS]

01:09:14.541 --> 01:09:15.834
[YELLS]

01:09:17.669 --> 01:09:20.672
And look at this.
Maverick scoring big.

01:09:21.840 --> 01:09:23.174
Oh, it's so cute.

01:09:23.258 --> 01:09:26.219
It's got the little paws
and the whiskers.

01:09:26.303 --> 01:09:27.304
Whoa.

01:09:29.431 --> 01:09:32.100
Chicken Joe
with a no-paddle drop-in! Ha!

01:09:32.183 --> 01:09:34.436
[IMITATES MOTOR REVVING]
Here we go!

01:09:34.519 --> 01:09:36.688
Nobody needs
to help this chicken.

01:09:36.772 --> 01:09:38.816
Woo-hoo!
I'm flying!

01:09:38.899 --> 01:09:40.484
- [ALL CHEERING]
- Alakazoo!

01:09:40.567 --> 01:09:42.152
Maverick and Joe tied,

01:09:42.319 --> 01:09:44.738
and no score for Tank Evans?

01:09:44.822 --> 01:09:45.739
Unbelievable.

01:09:47.116 --> 01:09:50.745
[SAL] Surfers,
this is your final wave!

01:09:51.370 --> 01:09:53.790
Joe, man, this is it.
This wave wins it, huh?

01:09:53.873 --> 01:09:54.791
Yeah, man!

01:09:55.249 --> 01:09:56.250
Whoo!

01:09:57.543 --> 01:10:01.631
[SAL] This wave is stacking up
to be a beautiful tube.

01:10:02.256 --> 01:10:04.801
Maverick should score big
on this one!

01:10:06.135 --> 01:10:07.428
[TANK ROARING]

01:10:07.512 --> 01:10:09.555
[SAL]
But wait! Evans drops in.

01:10:09.639 --> 01:10:10.640
[GASPS]

01:10:10.723 --> 01:10:13.058
It looks like Evans
is gonna take out the chicken.

01:10:19.148 --> 01:10:20.441
[SAL]
What's Maverick doing?

01:10:20.525 --> 01:10:21.651
Go, Joe, go!

01:10:21.901 --> 01:10:23.361
Got it! Let's go!

01:10:23.444 --> 01:10:24.612
[SAL]
I don't believe this.

01:10:24.696 --> 01:10:26.614
This contest
was Maverick's to win.

01:10:26.698 --> 01:10:29.200
And now Evans pushing Maverick
out of bounds

01:10:29.283 --> 01:10:30.451
and into The Boneyards.

01:10:32.286 --> 01:10:33.204
Whoa!

01:10:33.287 --> 01:10:34.205
[COUGHS]

01:10:34.706 --> 01:10:35.874
[GRUNTING]

01:10:40.294 --> 01:10:41.253
[ALL GASPING]

01:10:41.379 --> 01:10:42.338
Whoa!

01:10:42.421 --> 01:10:45.049
[GASPS]
Tank, look out!

01:10:45.132 --> 01:10:46.300
You look out!
[GRUNTS]

01:10:46.384 --> 01:10:47.259
[LAUGHS]

01:10:47.343 --> 01:10:48.260
[SCREAMS]

01:10:52.557 --> 01:10:54.392
[CROWD MURMURING]

01:10:54.475 --> 01:10:55.685
[GRUNTS]

01:11:00.147 --> 01:11:01.232
[PANTING]

01:11:01.482 --> 01:11:02.441
[GASPS]

01:11:05.904 --> 01:11:07.279
[GRUNTING]

01:11:17.707 --> 01:11:18.624
[GRUNTING]

01:11:20.251 --> 01:11:21.044
[YELPS]

01:11:21.502 --> 01:11:22.587
Code!

01:11:25.006 --> 01:11:25.840
Z!

01:11:28.300 --> 01:11:29.176
[GRUNTS]

01:11:30.344 --> 01:11:31.387
Cody, come on.

01:11:31.470 --> 01:11:33.305
- Z!
- Paddle! Come on!

01:11:33.389 --> 01:11:35.767
Dig faster!
Come on, dig! Dig!

01:11:37.309 --> 01:11:39.311
Don't dig. Don't dig.

01:11:39.604 --> 01:11:40.563
What?

01:11:41.773 --> 01:11:43.858
Let the wave carry you, Cody!

01:11:43.983 --> 01:11:44.901
Z!

01:11:44.984 --> 01:11:46.277
You're gonna have to time it!

01:11:47.111 --> 01:11:49.697
You're gonna come right here,
right to me!

01:11:51.032 --> 01:11:52.117
[GRUNTS]

01:11:53.493 --> 01:11:55.662
Five, four...

01:11:56.121 --> 01:11:58.415
Three, two, one.

01:12:03.796 --> 01:12:04.713
Z!

01:12:05.631 --> 01:12:06.548
[GRUNTS]

01:12:19.603 --> 01:12:21.271
Wha... Where's Cody?

01:12:21.730 --> 01:12:22.648
[SIGHS]

01:12:24.232 --> 01:12:26.068
[CROWD MURMURING]

01:12:26.234 --> 01:12:27.653
Don't touch it!
Don't touch that!

01:12:28.445 --> 01:12:31.239
This is a reminder
of the young surfer

01:12:31.824 --> 01:12:33.659
who gave his life

01:12:34.409 --> 01:12:36.662
for the sport he loved.

01:12:38.789 --> 01:12:40.373
[BOTH PANTING]

01:12:40.958 --> 01:12:42.042
Ah, there you are.

01:12:42.126 --> 01:12:43.376
[BOTH GRUNT]

01:12:46.463 --> 01:12:47.297
[PANTING]

01:12:47.881 --> 01:12:50.592
I can't believe it!
I can't believe it.

01:12:52.177 --> 01:12:53.303
You came back.

01:12:53.971 --> 01:12:55.597
You saved my life, man.

01:12:55.889 --> 01:12:56.932
Thank you, man.
Thank you.

01:12:57.016 --> 01:12:57.933
Hey, hey, hey, hey.

01:12:58.017 --> 01:12:59.559
Come on, come on, come on.
You're gonna tip us.

01:13:00.310 --> 01:13:01.311
[SIGHS]

01:13:01.979 --> 01:13:02.980
Well...

01:13:03.605 --> 01:13:04.523
I lost.

01:13:04.606 --> 01:13:05.482
Yeah.

01:13:06.441 --> 01:13:07.484
Me too.

01:13:09.402 --> 01:13:10.904
[CHUCKLES]
Come on.

01:13:11.488 --> 01:13:12.614
Let's go, loser.

01:13:14.033 --> 01:13:15.325
You wanna help me out here?

01:13:15.784 --> 01:13:17.161
You know the routine.
Come on.

01:13:17.243 --> 01:13:19.329
- Long. Yeah, that's it.
- Smooth strokes.

01:13:19.412 --> 01:13:20.580
Smooth, you know.
Come on.

01:13:21.040 --> 01:13:23.416
[REGGIE] Young Joey
MacEnroe was a beacon

01:13:24.459 --> 01:13:26.170
for a new generation.

01:13:26.252 --> 01:13:28.797
- May he rest in peace.
- [SOBBING]

01:13:31.050 --> 01:13:32.342
So, what are my bids
for the board?

01:13:32.425 --> 01:13:34.178
Who'll give me 30? Thirty,
give me 30, come on. Thirty.

01:13:34.260 --> 01:13:35.679
Don't touch his stuff, man.

01:13:35.762 --> 01:13:36.889
- Pal, if you wanna bid...
- Gimme that.

01:13:36.972 --> 01:13:38.098
Hey, hey, hey, hey. Um...

01:13:40.184 --> 01:13:41.101
[GASPS]

01:13:41.185 --> 01:13:42.102
[GASPS]

01:13:42.435 --> 01:13:43.896
[CROWD MURMURING]

01:13:44.521 --> 01:13:46.065
Hey. Hey, everyone.

01:13:46.815 --> 01:13:48.067
Heh, how you been?

01:13:48.316 --> 01:13:49.735
- Oh, my gosh!
- Oh...

01:13:49.818 --> 01:13:50.694
Yeah.

01:13:50.777 --> 01:13:51.778
[PENGUIN]
Hey, man, that's Z!

01:13:51.987 --> 01:13:53.113
That's me.

01:13:53.864 --> 01:13:55.825
Skank, what's happening, man?

01:13:56.367 --> 01:13:58.494
Got a little sand
in your egg sack there, fella.

01:13:58.578 --> 01:13:59.495
[CROWD LAUGHS]

01:13:59.579 --> 01:14:01.330
Where have you been,
Z? What happened?

01:14:02.289 --> 01:14:03.332
Oh, you know...

01:14:04.667 --> 01:14:07.378
I, uh, I got lost
for a little while.

01:14:07.712 --> 01:14:09.172
Uh, but, uh, that kid,

01:14:09.255 --> 01:14:10.464
that kid there, Cody...

01:14:11.591 --> 01:14:14.219
he, uh, He pointed the way back.

01:14:14.301 --> 01:14:15.344
[FOOTSTEPS PATTERING]

01:14:15.428 --> 01:14:16.303
[MOANS]

01:14:20.808 --> 01:14:23.728
Cody, Cody, Cody, Cody, Cody!

01:14:25.396 --> 01:14:27.857
[TEARFULLY] Could you please shut that
off? You know, could you give me a minute?

01:14:33.238 --> 01:14:35.907
Hey, hey! Check it out!
How about this?

01:14:36.116 --> 01:14:37.408
You wanna talk
about talent scout?

01:14:37.617 --> 01:14:38.659
People find talent.

01:14:38.743 --> 01:14:40.828
I bring 'em back from the dead.

01:14:41.162 --> 01:14:42.956
The now living legend...

01:14:43.039 --> 01:14:43.957
Reggie, Reggie, shut...

01:14:44.040 --> 01:14:45.208
- Ladies and...
- Shut up.

01:14:45.291 --> 01:14:46.876
- What? Shut up? What?
- I'm not a legend.

01:14:46.960 --> 01:14:48.795
I'm just a guy
looking for some nice waves,

01:14:48.878 --> 01:14:49.963
some good friends.

01:14:50.337 --> 01:14:51.672
- Ow! Hello.
- Hey, guys,

01:14:51.839 --> 01:14:53.967
the swell is happening
over on the north shore!

01:14:54.050 --> 01:14:55.009
[CROWD APPLAUDS]

01:14:55.093 --> 01:14:56.886
- I'm right behind you, Z.
- Ouch, that, that hurt.

01:14:58.512 --> 01:14:59.472
[PENGUIN]
Gimme a hand with this.

01:14:59.555 --> 01:15:01.015
Hey, come back here!

01:15:01.099 --> 01:15:02.016
[ARNOLD]
We love you, Z!

01:15:02.100 --> 01:15:03.601
You don't just walk away!
Come on!

01:15:04.393 --> 01:15:06.604
Folks, it looks like he's
taking this loss pretty hard.

01:15:06.687 --> 01:15:09.398
- [SNIFFLING] - Tank, how
does it feel to lose after nine time...

01:15:11.400 --> 01:15:12.235
I wasn't kissing her.

01:15:12.777 --> 01:15:14.279
You can't have her!

01:15:14.361 --> 01:15:15.571
[KIDS CLAMORING]

01:15:15.655 --> 01:15:16.656
[SCREAMS]

01:15:16.739 --> 01:15:18.324
Guys, guys.
Can we get a few words?

01:15:18.407 --> 01:15:19.242
- Hey.
- Oh, hey, Rob.

01:15:19.325 --> 01:15:21.119
So you gave up the trophy
to help Joe, man.

01:15:21.202 --> 01:15:22.162
What's that about?

01:15:22.245 --> 01:15:23.537
Well, you know, Rob,
that's, uh...

01:15:23.746 --> 01:15:25.081
- That's what friends do.
- Yeah.

01:15:25.165 --> 01:15:26.166
How's it feel to win, Joe?

01:15:27.333 --> 01:15:28.293
I won?

01:15:28.375 --> 01:15:29.376
Come on!

01:15:29.710 --> 01:15:30.670
I'll tell my mom.

01:15:30.753 --> 01:15:31.963
Gimme, gimme, gimme!

01:15:32.046 --> 01:15:32.964
[TANK SCREAMS]

01:15:33.089 --> 01:15:33.923
Oops.

01:15:34.007 --> 01:15:35.216
Oh, Lia! Oh. Oh, uh...

01:15:35.300 --> 01:15:36.176
Oh, Lia.

01:15:36.550 --> 01:15:38.136
Don't you walk away from me!

01:15:38.219 --> 01:15:40.138
I am Reggie Belafon...

01:15:40.221 --> 01:15:41.097
[WIG RIPS]

01:15:41.181 --> 01:15:42.431
Oh! Turn that thing off.

01:15:42.640 --> 01:15:44.851
Mikey! You are so fired!

01:15:45.768 --> 01:15:48.104
I can't imagine a better day!

01:15:48.188 --> 01:15:50.606
[UPBEAT SONG PLAYING]

01:15:54.610 --> 01:15:55.486
[CODY]
Dude, this,

01:15:55.569 --> 01:15:57.197
I mean, this whole experience
has just been...

01:15:58.906 --> 01:16:00.826
It's amazing. Z?

01:16:01.827 --> 01:16:05.831
I don't think I've ever had a
better friend to me in my life.

01:16:06.790 --> 01:16:10.418
- It's just really cool to have everything I need.
- Whoo-hoo!

01:16:11.378 --> 01:16:12.671
- Don't do it!
- Help!

01:16:12.754 --> 01:16:13.797
Oh, Arnold!

01:16:14.006 --> 01:16:15.632
To be honest, man,
I'm kind of, like,

01:16:15.841 --> 01:16:17.634
bored of talking
about myself, so...

01:16:18.426 --> 01:16:20.554
Is that cool?
You guys got what you need?

01:16:21.013 --> 01:16:22.181
[INTERVIEWER]
Yeah. Yeah, we got it.

01:16:22.264 --> 01:16:23.224
All right. Be good.

01:16:27.228 --> 01:16:28.145
Hey!

01:16:28.229 --> 01:16:29.604
[PEN GUANS CHEERING]

01:16:32.482 --> 01:16:33.567
[MIKE]
Cowabunga!

01:16:36.820 --> 01:16:37.779
[LAUGHING]

01:16:57.465 --> 01:16:58.800
[SONG CONTINUES]

01:17:40.550 --> 01:17:41.718
[REGGAE SONG PLAYING]

01:17:41.802 --> 01:17:43.887
Oh, of course
we're proud of him.

01:17:43.971 --> 01:17:45.639
I mean, what mother
wouldn't be proud of him?

01:17:45.847 --> 01:17:48.434
We're so full of proudness.

01:17:48.516 --> 01:17:49.393
You know what?

01:17:49.476 --> 01:17:51.603
He followed his dream,
and he went out there,

01:17:51.686 --> 01:17:54.315
and now he's coming home
with the trophy.

01:17:54.398 --> 01:17:56.483
I mean, I can't wait
to see the trophy.

01:17:56.566 --> 01:17:58.277
[INTERVIEWER] Well,
there's not really a trophy.

01:17:59.569 --> 01:18:01.571
Oh, is there like a big shell
or something like that?

01:18:01.696 --> 01:18:03.198
There's no shell.
There's no trophy.

01:18:03.282 --> 01:18:04.367
- He didn't...
- What is there?

01:18:04.451 --> 01:18:05.827
- Well, he didn't win.
- [CHUCKLES] What?

01:18:06.661 --> 01:18:07.787
How bad, how bad was it?

01:18:07.870 --> 01:18:09.331
I mean, did he get smoked?

01:18:09.414 --> 01:18:10.999
Well, he was in the finals.
He was in the finals.

01:18:11.082 --> 01:18:12.750
Second place?
Yeah, that's losing.

01:18:12.834 --> 01:18:14.669
Winning is not everything, Glen.

01:18:14.752 --> 01:18:15.837
- Right.
- I mean, look at...

01:18:15.920 --> 01:18:17.172
- Look at what Cody did...
- Wait, wait.

01:18:17.255 --> 01:18:18.923
Go back to the "winning
isn't everything" thing.

01:18:19.632 --> 01:18:21.634
That doesn't compute, really.

01:18:21.717 --> 01:18:22.635
You know what, Glen?

01:18:22.718 --> 01:18:24.595
I really hope that someday

01:18:24.846 --> 01:18:26.431
you can be more like Cody.

01:18:27.974 --> 01:18:29.017
This interview's over.

01:18:31.644 --> 01:18:32.979
[REGGAE SONG CONTINUES]

01:18:47.660 --> 01:18:48.703
[SONG CONTINUES]

01:19:08.639 --> 01:19:09.891
[SONG CONTINUES]

01:19:33.664 --> 01:19:34.916
[SONG CONTINUES]

01:19:57.939 --> 01:20:00.191
[ROCK 'N' ROLL MUSIC PLAYING]

01:20:24.674 --> 01:20:25.926
[MUSIC CONTINUES]

01:21:10.971 --> 01:21:13.015
[POP SONG PLAYING]

01:21:52.638 --> 01:21:53.847
[SONG CONTINUES]

01:22:17.163 --> 01:22:18.415
[SONG CONTINUES]

01:23:05.503 --> 01:23:06.921
[UKULELE PLAYING
CHEERFUL MELODY]

01:23:44.375 --> 01:23:46.127
[BIG Z] You know, I think
it's actually called an,

01:23:46.294 --> 01:23:49.297
An "ook" I think
is the proper pronunciation.

01:23:49.714 --> 01:23:50.715
It's important.

01:23:51.341 --> 01:23:53.384
Little island, uh,
north of here.

01:23:54.302 --> 01:23:56.012
"Ha-va-ii" or something
like that.

01:23:56.554 --> 01:23:57.806
Always wanted to go.

01:23:58.139 --> 01:23:59.599
Big waves bigtime.

01:23:59.683 --> 01:24:00.600
Yeah.

01:24:01.017 --> 01:24:02.185
Ook, ook.

01:24:02.935 --> 01:24:04.479
I think. I think it's "ook."

01:24:06.022 --> 01:24:07.774
Anyway, here we go.
You ready?

01:24:07.857 --> 01:24:11.110
All right, join in if you think
you can do this.

01:25:00.327 --> 01:25:01.995
Remember when we were
talking about you leaving?

01:25:02.079 --> 01:25:04.456
That was great. Remember when
you were gonna go? Remember that?

01:25:04.540 --> 01:25:05.708
[INTERVIEWER]
We're gonna go, but...

01:25:05.791 --> 01:25:06.834
Yeah, you should still go.

01:25:06.917 --> 01:25:08.043
It's technical equipment.

01:25:08.126 --> 01:25:09.336
I know what I'm doing.

01:25:09.420 --> 01:25:11.839
I can unplug one of your
little Hollywood devices.

01:25:11.922 --> 01:25:13.549
- Please, don't touch that.
- The lighting thing.

01:25:13.632 --> 01:25:16.134
- [EDNA] Glen!
- Whatever you call that. And then the microphone thing.

01:25:16.510 --> 01:25:17.428
- I'm sorry.
- It's easy.

01:25:17.511 --> 01:25:18.721
Go back to Hollywood.

01:25:18.804 --> 01:25:19.971
[EDNA] Glen, Cody
would never do this.
